    },
    "mistake.003.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you need similar logic, you copy existing code and tweak a few parts. The code to fetch a user list and the code to fetch an order list are 90% identical, yet you write each separately. Later, when a bug turns up in the shared part, you have to hunt down every pasted copy and fix each one, and if you miss even one, the same bug comes back somewhere else."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you need similar logic, you copy existing code and tweak a few bits. The code for fetching a list of users and a list of orders is 90% identical, yet you write each separately. Later, when a bug turns up in the shared part, you have to hunt down every pasted copy and fix each one, and if you miss a single one, the same bug comes back elsewhere."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "비슷한 로직이 필요할 때 기존 코드를 복붙해서 일부만 수정합니다. 유저 목록 조회와 주문 목록 조회의 코드가 90% 동일한데 각각 따로 작성합니다. 나중에 공통 부분에 버그가 발견되면, 복붙한 모든 곳을 찾아 일일이 수정해야 하고, 하나라도 놓치면 같은 버그가 다른 곳에서 재발합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要类似逻辑时，直接把现有代码复制过来改几处。用户列表查询和订单列表查询的代码 90% 一样，却各写了一份。之后公共部分发现 Bug，就得把所有复制的地方找出来逐个修，漏掉一处，同样的 Bug 就会在别处再次出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.004.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write comments that explain the why. Leave the business context, the background of the decision, and related issue numbers, like // Extra discount for VIP customers based on annual purchases (requested by marketing, 2024 Q3, JIRA-1234). For complex algorithms, put a block comment before the function summarizing the overall flow."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write comments that explain the \"why\". Leave the business context, the reasoning behind the decision and any related ticket numbers, as in // VIP customers get an extra discount based on annual purchases (requested by Marketing, Q3 2024, JIRA-1234). For complex algorithms, put a block comment before the function summarising the overall flow."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "'Why'를 설명하는 주석을 작성하세요. // VIP 등급 고객은 연간 구매 실적에 따라 추가 할인 적용 (2024 Q3 마케팅팀 요청, JIRA-1234) 같은 비즈니스 맥락, 의사결정 배경, 관련 이슈 번호를 남기세요. 복잡한 알고리즘에는 전체 흐름을 요약하는 블록 주석을 함수 앞에 작성하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写解释“Why”的注释。比如 // VIP 客户按年度消费额享受额外折扣（2024 Q3 市场部需求，JIRA-1234），把业务背景、决策原因、相关工单号留下来。对复杂算法，在函数前用块注释概括整体流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.004.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand that the code itself says What, comments say Why, and documentation says How. A good comment is a gift that lets future developers, including you, understand the code and change it with confidence."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to see that the \"what\" is told by the code itself, the \"why\" by comments and the \"how\" by documentation. A good comment is a gift to future developers (yourself included), letting them understand the code and change it with confidence."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "코드의 'What'은 코드 자체가 말하고, 'Why'는 주석이 말하고, 'How'는 문서가 말하는 것을 이해하게 됩니다. 좋은 주석은 미래의 개발자(나 포함)가 코드를 이해하고 자신 있게 수정할 수 있게 해주는 선물입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会明白：代码本身说明“What”，注释说明“Why”，文档说明“How”。好注释是送给未来开发者（包括你自己）的礼物，让人能看懂代码并放心地修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
