    },
    "mistake.004.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A discount calculation has a triple-nested condition and no comment. Half a year later, when a change request comes in, nobody can explain why it was written that way. Reading the code shows what it does, but not why it does it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A discount calculation contains a triple-nested condition with no comment, so when a change request arrives six months later, nobody can explain why it was written that way. Reading the code shows you what it does, but not why."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "할인율 계산에 3중 조건문이 들어가는데 주석이 없어서, 반년 후 기획 변경 요청이 왔을 때 왜 이렇게 작성했는지 아무도 설명할 수 없습니다. 코드를 읽어도 '무엇을 하는지'는 보이지만 '왜 이렇게 하는지'는 알 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "折扣计算里有三层嵌套条件，却没写注释。半年后产品要改需求，没人能说清当初为什么这样写。读代码能看出“做了什么”，却看不出“为什么这样做”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.005.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write code that explains itself. With good variable and function names, most comments become unnecessary. When you feel a comment is needed, first check whether you can refactor the code so it's clear without one. Use comments only to explain why, or to record the background of a non-obvious decision."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write code that explains itself. With good variable and function names, most comments become unnecessary. When you feel a comment is needed, first check whether you can refactor the code so that it's clear without one. Use comments only to explain \"why\", or to record the background to a non-obvious decision."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "코드가 스스로 설명하도록 작성하세요. 변수명과 함수명이 좋으면 대부분의 주석은 불필요합니다. 주석이 필요하다고 느껴지면, 먼저 코드를 리팩토링해서 주석 없이도 이해되게 만들 수 있는지 검토하세요. 주석은 '왜'를 설명할 때, 또는 비직관적인 결정의 배경을 남길 때만 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让代码自己说话。变量名和函数名起得好，大部分注释都是多余的。觉得需要注释时，先想想能不能通过重构，让代码不加注释也能看懂。注释只用来解释“为什么”，或者记录反直觉决定的背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.005.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build the ability to write self-documenting code. The more readable your code, the less you need comments, and the comments you do write in the right places carry far more value."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You develop the ability to write self-documenting code. Readable code reduces the need for comments, and the comments that remain, written where they are truly needed, are worth far more."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "자기 설명적 코드(Self-documenting code)를 작성하는 능력을 기르게 됩니다. 가독성 높은 코드를 작성하면 주석의 필요성이 줄어들고, 정말 필요한 곳에 작성된 주석은 더 큰 가치를 발휘합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会培养写自解释代码（Self-documenting code）的能力。代码可读性高了，对注释的需求就少了，而真正需要的地方写下的注释，价值反而更大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.005.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
