    "mistake.005.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You write obvious comments on every line, like let count = 0; // initialize count to 0. When the code changes, the comments need to change too, but you forget to update them and the code and comments drift apart. A comment that lies is worse than no comment at all."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You write obvious comments on every line, such as let count = 0; // initialise count to zero. When the code changes the comments have to change too, but you forget to update them, and the code and comments end up disagreeing. A comment that lies is worse than no comment at all."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "let count = 0; // 카운트를 0으로 초기화한다 같은 자명한 주석을 모든 줄에 작성합니다. 코드가 변경되면 주석도 함께 수정해야 하는데, 주석 업데이트를 빠뜨려서 코드와 주석이 불일치하는 상황이 발생합니다. 거짓말하는 주석은 없는 것보다 해롭습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行都写 let count = 0; // 把计数初始化为 0 这种一目了然的注释。代码改了，注释也得跟着改，一旦漏改，代码和注释就对不上了。说谎的注释比没有注释更有害。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.006.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create a constant that gives meaning to every literal value: const MAX_RETRY_COUNT = 3, const ONE_DAY_MS = 86400000, const ROLE_ADMIN = 2. Let the name alone carry the meaning. If you keep your constants in one place, a policy change means editing just one line."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create a constant that gives meaning to every literal value. Let the name alone carry the meaning, as in const MAX_RETRY_COUNT = 3, const ONE_DAY_MS = 86400000 and const ROLE_ADMIN = 2. If you keep constants together in one place, a policy change means editing just one line."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "모든 리터럴 값에 의미를 부여하는 상수를 만드세요. const MAX_RETRY_COUNT = 3, const ONE_DAY_MS = 86400000, const ROLE_ADMIN = 2처럼 이름만으로 의미가 전달되게 하세요. 상수를 한 곳에 모아 관리하면 정책 변경 시 한 줄만 수정하면 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给每个字面量都建一个有意义的常量。像 const MAX_RETRY_COUNT = 3、const ONE_DAY_MS = 86400000、const ROLE_ADMIN = 2 这样，光看名字就知道含义。把常量集中到一处管理，策略变化时只需改一行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
