    "mistake.006.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Code like if (retryCount > 3), setTimeout(() => {}, 86400000), and if (role === 2) is scattered everywhere. Only the author knows what the 3, the 86400000, and the 2 mean. When the policy changes and the retry count has to become 5, you have to find every 3 in the codebase, and since other 3s mean other things, you risk changing the wrong one."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Code such as if (retryCount > 3), setTimeout(() => {}, 86400000) and if (role === 2) is scattered everywhere. Only the author knows what the 3, the 86400000 and the 2 mean. When the policy changes and you need to raise the retry count to 5, you have to search the whole codebase for 3, and there are other 3s with different meanings, so you risk changing the wrong one."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "if (retryCount > 3), setTimeout(() => {}, 86400000), if (role === 2) 같은 코드가 여기저기 흩어져 있습니다. 3이 뭐고, 86400000은 뭐고, 2가 뭔지 작성자만 알고 있습니다. 정책이 바뀌어 재시도 횟수를 5로 늘려야 할 때, 코드 전체에서 3을 찾아야 하는데 다른 의미의 3도 있어 잘못 수정할 위험이 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "if (retryCount > 3)、setTimeout(() => {}, 86400000)、if (role === 2) 这类代码到处都是。3 是什么、86400000 是什么、2 又是什么，只有作者自己知道。策略变了要把重试次数改成 5，就得在整个代码库里找 3，其中还混着含义不同的 3，改错的风险很大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.007.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follow your team's coding conventions, and set up automation like ESLint, Prettier, or SwiftLint in your project. If you set up format-on-save, you won't even have to think about style. If there are no conventions yet, propose some to your team and use an industry standard (such as the Airbnb Style Guide) as a starting point."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follow the coding conventions your team has set, and set up automated tools such as ESLint, Prettier and SwiftLint in your project. If you configure formatting on save, you no longer even need to think about style. If there are no conventions, suggest some to your team and use an industry standard (such as the Airbnb Style Guide) as a starting point."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "팀이 정한 코딩 컨벤션을 따르고, ESLint, Prettier, SwiftLint 같은 자동화 도구를 프로젝트에 설정하세요. 저장 시 자동 포맷팅을 설정하면 스타일에 대해 생각할 필요조차 없어집니다. 컨벤션이 없다면 팀에 제안하고, 업계 표준(Airbnb Style Guide 등)을 출발점으로 삼으세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遵循团队制定的编码规范，并在项目里配置 ESLint、Prettier、SwiftLint 等自动化工具。设置保存时自动格式化，你就完全不用再操心风格问题。如果还没有规范，就向团队提议，并以行业标准（如 Airbnb Style Guide）为起点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
