    "mistake.008.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You swallow errors with try { ... } catch(e) {}. The service behaves strangely, but there's no error log, so you can't find the cause. Users report that payments aren't going through, and the server has no record of anything."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You swallow errors with try { ... } catch(e) {}. The service behaves strangely, but with no error log you can't find the cause. Users report that payments aren't going through, yet there is no record at all on the server."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "try { ... } catch(e) {} 로 에러를 삼켜버립니다. 서비스가 이상하게 동작하는데 에러 로그가 없어서 원인을 찾을 수 없습니다. 사용자는 결제가 안 된다고 문의하는데, 서버에는 아무런 기록이 없는 상황이 발생합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 try { ... } catch(e) {} 把错误吞掉。服务行为异常，却没有任何错误日志，找不到原因。用户反馈支付不了，服务器上却什么记录都没有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.009.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Minimize variable scope. Pass data through function parameters, return values, and dependency injection. When you need state management, use a state management library like Redux or Zustand, or instance variables on a class, so the paths of state changes can be traced clearly."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep the scope of your variables as small as possible. Pass data around through function parameters, return values and dependency injection. If you need state management, use a library such as Redux or Zustand, or instance variables on a class, so that the path of every state change can be traced clearly."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "변수의 스코프를 최소화하세요. 함수 파라미터, 반환값, 의존성 주입으로 데이터를 전달하세요. 상태 관리가 필요하면 Redux, Zustand 같은 상태 관리 라이브러리나, 클래스의 인스턴스 변수를 사용해 상태 변경 경로를 명확하게 추적할 수 있게 하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把变量的作用域缩到最小。通过函数参数、返回值、依赖注入来传递数据。需要管理状态时，使用 Redux、Zustand 这类状态管理库，或类的实例变量，让状态变化的路径清晰可追踪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.009.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand the principles of state management and scope. You feel the value of a functional programming mindset that minimizes side effects, and of immutability, which is a core skill for keeping complex applications predictable."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand the principles of state management and scope. You feel the value of immutability and the functional-programming mindset of minimising side effects, which is the key to making a complex application predictable."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "상태 관리와 스코프의 원칙을 이해하게 됩니다. 사이드 이펙트를 최소화하는 함수형 프로그래밍 사고방식, 불변성(immutability)의 가치를 체감하며, 이는 복잡한 애플리케이션을 예측 가능하게 만드는 핵심 능력입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会理解状态管理和作用域的原则，体会到尽量减少副作用的函数式编程思维和不可变性（immutability）的价值，这是让复杂应用可预测的核心能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.009.mistake" : {
