    "mistake.009.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You use global variables because they're convenient to share across several functions. As the app grows, it becomes impossible to track which function changes a global and when, and fixing one feature breaks another that seems totally unrelated."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You use global variables because they're convenient for sharing between several functions. As the app grows, it becomes impossible to trace which function changes a global variable and when, and a change to one feature breaks another that looks completely unrelated."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "여러 함수에서 공유하기 편하다는 이유로 전역 변수를 사용합니다. 앱이 커지면서 어떤 함수가 전역 변수를 언제 변경하는지 추적이 불가능해지고, 한 기능의 수정이 전혀 관련 없어 보이는 다른 기능을 망가뜨립니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "觉得多个函数之间共享方便，就用全局变量。应用变大后，根本没法追踪哪个函数在什么时候改了全局变量，改一个功能，结果把看似毫不相关的另一个功能弄坏了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.010.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make good use of optional chaining (user?.profile?.address?.city) and default values (nullish coalescing, ?? 'No address'). Put guard clauses at the top of your functions: if (!user) return null; If you use TypeScript, turn on strictNullChecks to guarantee null safety at compile time."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make good use of optional chaining (user?.profile?.address?.city) and default values (nullish coalescing, ?? 'No address entered'). Put guard clauses at the start of your functions: if (!user) return null; If you use TypeScript, turn on strictNullChecks so that null safety is guaranteed at compile time."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "옵셔널 체이닝(user?.profile?.address?.city)과 기본값(nullish coalescing, ?? '주소 미입력')을 적극 활용하세요. 함수 시작 부분에 가드 클로즈를 배치하세요: if (!user) return null; 타입스크립트를 사용한다면 strictNullChecks를 켜서 컴파일 타임에 null 안전성을 보장하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "积极使用可选链（user?.profile?.address?.city）和默认值（空值合并，?? '未填写地址'）。在函数开头放置卫语句：if (!user) return null;。如果用 TypeScript，就开启 strictNullChecks，在编译期保证 null 安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.010.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You internalize the defensive programming mindset. The habit of always asking first, 'Could this value be missing?', dramatically cuts runtime crashes. You also see why language-level null safety, like Swift's Optional and Kotlin's nullable types, matters."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You absorb the mindset of defensive programming. Making \"might this value be missing?\" your first thought dramatically reduces runtime crashes. You'll also see why language-level null safety, such as Swift's Optional and Kotlin's nullable types, matters so much."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "방어적 프로그래밍(Defensive Programming)의 사고방식을 체득합니다. '이 값이 없을 수 있는가?'를 항상 먼저 떠올리는 습관은 런타임 크래시를 극적으로 줄여줍니다. Swift의 Optional, Kotlin의 Nullable 같은 언어 차원의 null 안전성이 왜 중요한지도 이해하게 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会养成防御式编程（Defensive Programming）的思维。总是先想“这个值会不会不存在？”，能大幅减少运行时崩溃。你也会明白 Swift 的 Optional、Kotlin 的 Nullable 这类语言层面的 null 安全为什么重要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
