    "mistake.014.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While refactoring or adding a feature, you change 10 files and 500 lines in one go. When you run the tests, errors appear, but you can't tell which change caused them, so you have to revert everything and start over."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While refactoring or adding a feature, you change 10 files and 500 lines in one go. You run the tests and get errors, but you can't tell which change caused them, so you have to revert everything and start again from scratch."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "리팩토링이나 새 기능 추가를 하면서 10개의 파일, 500줄의 코드를 한 번에 변경합니다. 테스트를 돌리니 에러가 터지는데, 어떤 변경이 에러를 일으켰는지 알 수 없어서 전부 되돌리고 처음부터 다시 해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做重构或加新功能时，一次改了 10 个文件、500 行代码。跑测试时报错，却不知道是哪处改动引起的，只好全部回退，从头再来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.015.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use log levels systematically. DEBUG: detailed flow during development. INFO: normal business events. WARN: signs of potential problems. ERROR: actual errors and failures. Configure production to output INFO and above, and development to start from DEBUG. Structured logs (JSON format) make searching and filtering much easier in log analysis tools."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use log levels systematically. DEBUG: detailed flow during development. INFO: normal business events. WARN: signs of potential problems. ERROR: genuine errors and failures. Configure production to output INFO and above, and development to output from DEBUG. Structured logs (in JSON format) make searching and filtering much easier in log analysis tools."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "로그 레벨을 체계적으로 사용하세요. DEBUG: 개발 중 상세 흐름, INFO: 정상적인 비즈니스 이벤트, WARN: 잠재적 문제 징후, ERROR: 실제 에러와 실패. 프로덕션에서는 INFO 이상만, 개발에서는 DEBUG부터 출력하도록 설정하세요. 구조화된 로그(JSON 형식)를 사용하면 로그 분석 도구에서 검색과 필터링이 훨씬 쉬워집니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统地使用日志级别。DEBUG：开发时的详细流程；INFO：正常的业务事件；WARN：潜在问题的征兆；ERROR：真正的错误和失败。生产环境只输出 INFO 及以上，开发环境从 DEBUG 开始输出。使用结构化日志（JSON 格式），在日志分析工具里搜索和过滤会容易得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.015.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand observability. With all three pillars (logs, metrics, and tracing), you can diagnose production issues quickly. Good logging cuts incident response time from hours to minutes."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand the concept of observability. With the three pillars of logs, metrics and tracing in place, you can diagnose production issues quickly. Good logging cuts incident response time from hours to minutes."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "관찰 가능성(Observability)의 개념을 이해하게 됩니다. 로그, 메트릭, 트레이싱의 세 축을 갖추면 프로덕션 이슈를 빠르게 진단할 수 있습니다. 좋은 로깅은 장애 대응 시간을 시간 단위에서 분 단위로 줄입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会理解可观测性（Observability）的概念。具备日志、指标、链路追踪这三个维度，就能快速诊断生产问题。好的日志能把故障响应时间从以小时计缩短到以分钟计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
