    "mistake.015.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You use only console.log() and record debug info, normal processing, warnings, and errors all at the same level. When production goes down, you have to find the error among tens of thousands of log lines, and the debug logs slow down production."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Using only console.log(), you record debug information, normal processing, warnings and errors all at the same level. When production goes down, you have to find the error among tens of thousands of lines of logs, and debug logs drag down production performance."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "console.log()만 사용하여 디버그 정보, 정상 처리 기록, 경고, 에러를 모두 같은 레벨로 남깁니다. 프로덕션에서 장애가 나면 수만 줄의 로그 속에서 에러를 찾아야 하고, 디버그 로그가 프로덕션 성능을 저하시킵니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只用 console.log()，把调试信息、正常处理记录、警告、错误全部用同一个级别输出。生产环境一出故障，就要在几万行日志里找错误，而且调试日志还会拖慢生产环境的性能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.016.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep a mistake journal. Every time you fix a bug, write one line each for the cause, the fix, and how to prevent it. Looking back over the journal regularly reveals your own mistake patterns. For patterns that keep recurring, create a code review checklist or lint rules so they're caught automatically."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep a mistake journal. Each time you fix a bug, note down one line each for the cause, the fix and how to prevent it. Looking back over the journal from time to time reveals your own patterns of mistakes. For patterns that keep recurring, create a code review checklist or lint rules so they are caught automatically."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "실수 일지(Mistake Journal)를 만드세요. 버그를 고칠 때마다 '원인', '해결 방법', '예방 방법'을 한 줄씩 기록하세요. 주기적으로 일지를 돌아보면 자신만의 실수 패턴이 보입니다. 반복되는 패턴에 대해서는 코드 리뷰 체크리스트나 린트 규칙을 만들어 자동으로 감지하게 하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建立一本错误日志（Mistake Journal）。每修好一个 Bug，就用一句话记下“原因”“解决方法”“预防方法”。定期回顾，就能看出自己的错误模式。对反复出现的模式，制定代码评审清单或 Lint 规则，让它自动被发现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.016.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build self-awareness and meta-learning skills. Once you know your mistake patterns, you naturally become wary at those spots when writing code. Building a system for learning from mistakes works better than simply trying harder."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You develop self-awareness and the ability to learn how you learn. Once you know your patterns of mistakes, you naturally become wary at those points when writing code. Building a system for learning from mistakes is more effective than simply working harder."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "자기 인식(Self-awareness)과 메타 학습 능력을 기릅니다. 실수 패턴을 알면 코드를 작성할 때 해당 부분에서 자연스럽게 경계하게 됩니다. '실수에서 배우는 시스템'을 만드는 것이 단순히 열심히 하는 것보다 효과적입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会培养自我认知（Self-awareness）和元学习能力。知道了自己的错误模式，写代码到那个地方时就会自然警惕。建立“从错误中学习的系统”，比单纯地努力更有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
