            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Have you ever created a checklist or lint rule to prevent a recurring mistake?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "반복되는 실수를 방지하기 위한 체크리스트나 린트 규칙을 만든 적이 있나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你有没有为防止重复犯错，制定过检查清单或 Lint 规则？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.016.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can you find what the bugs you made over the past month have in common? In what situations do your mistakes mostly happen?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can you find what the bugs you made over the past month have in common? In what situations do your mistakes mostly occur?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지난 한 달간 만든 버그들의 공통점을 찾을 수 있나요? 어떤 상황에서 주로 실수가 발생하나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "能找出过去一个月里你制造的 Bug 的共同点吗？一般在什么情况下容易出错？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.016.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You repeatedly create the same kinds of bugs: array index out of range, off-by-one errors, async timing issues. Every time you fix one you think, 'Ah, this again,' and yet the same mistakes keep happening."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You keep producing similar kinds of bugs: array index out of range, off-by-one errors, asynchronous timing issues. Every time you fix one you think \"oh, this again\", yet the same mistakes carry on."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "배열 인덱스 범위 초과, off-by-one 에러, 비동기 타이밍 이슈 등 비슷한 유형의 버그를 반복적으로 만듭니다. 고칠 때마다 '아, 또 이거구나' 하면서도 같은 실수가 계속됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数组下标越界、差一错误（off-by-one）、异步时序问题……总是在制造同一类 Bug。每次修的时候都想“啊，又是这个”，可同样的错误还是不断出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.017.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Criticize the code, not the person. Instead of 'This code is weird,' say, 'How about improving this part this way?' Acknowledge that all code was written with the context and constraints of its time. Use git blame to understand context, not to assign blame."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Criticise the code, not the person. Rather than \"this code is strange\", say \"how about improving this part like this?\" Acknowledge that all code has context and constraints from when it was written. Use git blame to understand context, not to assign blame."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "코드에 대한 비판은 하되 사람에 대한 비난은 하지 마세요. '이 코드가 이상하다'가 아니라 '이 부분을 이렇게 개선하면 어떨까요?'로 표현하세요. 모든 코드에는 작성 당시의 맥락과 제약이 있다는 것을 인정하세요. git blame은 비난이 아니라 맥락 이해를 위해 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以批评代码，但不要攻击个人。别说“这段代码很奇怪”，而是说“这里这样改进，你觉得怎么样？”。要承认每段代码都有它写成时的背景和限制。用 git blame 是为了了解上下文，而不是追究责任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.017.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand that code quality is higher on teams with psychological safety. In a culture of blame, people hide mistakes, and hidden mistakes become bigger problems. A culture of constructive feedback is the soil for technical growth."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You come to understand that code quality is higher in a team with psychological safety. In a blame culture, people hide their mistakes, and hidden mistakes become bigger problems. A culture of constructive feedback is the soil in which technical growth takes root."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "심리적 안전감(Psychological Safety)이 있는 팀에서 코드 품질이 더 높아진다는 것을 이해하게 됩니다. 비난의 문화에서는 실수를 숨기게 되고, 숨겨진 실수는 더 큰 문제가 됩니다. 건설적 피드백 문화가 기술 성장의 토양입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会明白，有心理安全感（Psychological Safety）的团队，代码质量更高。在指责文化里，大家会隐瞒错误，而被隐瞒的错误会变成更大的问题。建设性的反馈文化，是技术成长的土壤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.017.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blaming the person when you find a bug in someone else's code"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blaming the person first when you find a bug in someone else's code"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "다른 사람이 작성한 코드에서 버그를 발견하면 비난부터 한다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发现别人代码里的 Bug，先是一通指责"
