        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.017.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You ask, 'Who wrote this code?' and trace the author with git blame. But it turns out it was a reasonable decision at the time, or code written in the middle of an urgent incident, or code you wrote yourself six months ago."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Who wrote this?\" you ask, and trace the author with git blame. Yet it turns out the decision was reasonable at the time, or the code was written during an urgent incident response, or it was code you wrote yourself six months ago."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "'누가 이런 코드를 작성한 거야?'라며 git blame으로 작성자를 추적합니다. 하지만 알고 보면 당시에는 합리적인 결정이었거나, 급한 장애 대응 중에 작성된 코드였거나, 자기 자신이 6개월 전에 작성한 코드였습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一边说“谁写出这种代码？”，一边用 git blame 追查作者。可一查才发现，那在当时是合理的决定，或是紧急处理故障时写的，甚至就是自己半年前写的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.018.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build a staging environment identical to production. Find the cause of production issues through logs and monitoring, verify fixes in a development environment, and then ship them through your normal deployment process. Grant only minimal read-only access to production, and record all access in audit logs."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build a staging environment identical to production. Work out the cause of production issues using logs and monitoring, verify fixes in the development environment and then apply them through the proper deployment process. Give production only minimal read-only access and keep an audit log of all access."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "프로덕션과 동일한 스테이징 환경을 구축하세요. 프로덕션 이슈는 로그와 모니터링으로 원인을 파악하고, 수정은 개발 환경에서 검증한 후 정상적인 배포 프로세스를 통해 반영하세요. 프로덕션 접근은 최소한의 읽기 전용 권한만 부여하고, 모든 접근을 감사 로그로 기록하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搭建和生产一致的预发布（staging）环境。生产问题用日志和监控找原因，修改先在开发环境验证，再走正常的部署流程上线。对生产环境只授予最小的只读权限，并用审计日志记录所有访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.018.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You feel the importance of environment separation and the value of a deployment pipeline. Once you internalize the principle that production is a place you don't touch, you naturally follow safe operating practices."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You feel the importance of environment separation and the value of a deployment pipeline. Once you internalise the principle that production is a place you don't touch, you naturally follow safe operating practices."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "환경 분리(Environment Separation)의 중요성과 배포 파이프라인의 가치를 체감합니다. 프로덕션은 '건들지 않는' 곳이라는 원칙을 내면화하면, 자연스럽게 안전한 운영 프랙티스를 따르게 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会体会到环境隔离（Environment Separation）的重要性和部署流水线的价值。把生产环境当成“不能碰”的地方，你自然就会遵循安全的运维实践。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.018.mistake" : {
