    "mistake.018.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Because there's no staging environment, or because it's a hassle, you log into the production server directly to edit code and check logs. During debugging, you accidentally delete data, or leave debug code behind that gets exposed to users."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Because there is no staging environment, or it feels like too much bother, you log in to the production server and edit code and check logs directly. During debugging you accidentally delete data, or leave debug code behind that is exposed to users."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "스테이징 환경이 없거나 귀찮아서, 프로덕션 서버에 직접 접속하여 코드를 수정하고 로그를 확인합니다. 디버깅 과정에서 실수로 데이터를 삭제하거나, 디버그 코드를 남겨두어 사용자에게 노출되는 사고가 발생합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因为没有预发布环境，或者嫌麻烦，直接登录生产服务器改代码、看日志。调试过程中不小心删了数据，或者把调试代码留在线上暴露给了用户，酿成事故。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.019.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Understand the code line by line before you paste it. If you can't explain why it works, it doesn't deserve a place in your project. Check the date of the answer and the library version, and cross-check against the official docs. The same goes for AI-generated code. Code you don't understand is a time bomb."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Understand code line by line before you paste it. Only if you can explain why it works does it deserve a place in your project. Check the date of the answer and the library version, and cross-check against the official documentation. The same goes for AI-generated code. Code you don't understand is a time bomb."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "복붙하기 전에 코드를 줄 단위로 이해하세요. '이 코드가 왜 동작하는지' 설명할 수 있어야 프로젝트에 넣을 자격이 있습니다. 답변의 날짜와 라이브러리 버전을 확인하고, 공식 문서로 교차 검증하세요. AI가 생성한 코드도 마찬가지입니다. 이해하지 못한 코드는 시한폭탄입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复制粘贴之前，先逐行理解代码。能解释“这段代码为什么能工作”，才有资格放进项目。确认回答的日期和库的版本，并对照官方文档交叉验证。AI 生成的代码也一样。看不懂的代码就是定时炸弹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.019.growth" : {
