    "mistake.019.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You drop code you found by searching straight into your project without understanding what it means. It works for now, but it might be a six-year-old answer that doesn't fit the current version, or have a security hole, or have performance problems. When something goes wrong later, you can't tell why the code is there or how to fix it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You take code you found through a search and drop it straight into your project without understanding what it means. It works for now, but the answer may be six years old and out of step with the current version, or contain a security hole or a performance problem. When something goes wrong later, you have no idea why the code is there or how to fix it."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "검색해서 찾은 코드를 의미를 이해하지 않고 그대로 프로젝트에 넣습니다. 당장은 동작하지만, 6년 전 답변이라 현재 버전과 맞지 않거나, 보안 취약점이 있거나, 성능 문제가 있는 코드일 수 있습니다. 나중에 문제가 생기면 왜 이 코드가 여기 있는지, 어떻게 고쳐야 하는지 알 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把搜到的代码不明所以地直接放进项目。虽然眼下能跑，但那可能是 6 年前的回答，与当前版本不匹配，可能有安全漏洞，也可能有性能问题。以后出了问题，你不知道这段代码为什么在这里，也不知道该怎么改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.020.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create a standard format for bug reports: 1) environment (OS, browser, app version), 2) repro steps (in order, starting from 1), 3) expected result, 4) actual result, 5) screenshot or video. If you can't reproduce it, systematically vary the conditions and try again. Network state, data size, timing, and user permissions are common variables."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create a standard format for bug reports: 1) environment (OS, browser, app version), 2) reproduction steps (numbered from step one), 3) expected result, 4) actual result, 5) screenshots or video. If you can't reproduce it, change the conditions systematically and keep trying. Network state, data size, timing and user permissions are common variables."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "버그 리포트의 표준 형식을 만드세요: 1) 환경(OS, 브라우저, 앱 버전), 2) 재현 단계(1번부터 순서대로), 3) 기대 결과, 4) 실제 결과, 5) 스크린샷/영상. 재현이 안 되면 조건을 체계적으로 변경하며 시도하세요. 네트워크 상태, 데이터 크기, 타이밍, 사용자 권한 등이 흔한 변수입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "制定标准的 Bug 报告格式：1) 环境（系统、浏览器、App 版本）；2) 复现步骤（从第 1 步按顺序写）；3) 预期结果；4) 实际结果；5) 截图/视频。复现不了，就系统地改变条件去尝试。网络状态、数据量、时序、用户权限等是常见的变量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.020.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build systematic problem reporting and tracking skills. A good bug report cuts resolution time in half and raises the whole team's debugging efficiency. This is a foundational skill for raising the level of your engineering culture."
