    "mistake.024.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A conflict comes up, and without understanding the intent of both sides you keep only your own code, or blindly click the IDE's suggested 'Accept Both.' A teammate's carefully written code disappears, or both sets of code get combined in a way that doesn't make logical sense."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a conflict occurs, you keep only your own code without understanding the intent of both sides, or click the IDE's \"Accept Both\" without thinking. A teammate's carefully written code disappears, or the two sets of code are combined in a way that makes no logical sense."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "충돌이 발생했는데, 양쪽 코드의 의도를 이해하지 않고 자기 코드만 남기거나, IDE가 제안하는 'Accept Both'를 무분별하게 클릭합니다. 다른 팀원이 정성들여 작성한 코드가 사라지거나, 양쪽 코드가 논리적으로 맞지 않게 합쳐집니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遇到冲突，没弄懂两边代码的意图，就只留自己的代码，或者不加分辨地点 IDE 建议的“Accept Both”。结果同事精心写的代码消失了，或者两边代码合在一起逻辑对不上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.025.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Store secrets in a .env file and be sure to add it to .gitignore. In CI/CD, use environment variables or a secrets manager (AWS Secrets Manager, Vault, and so on). If a secret has already been committed, revoke that key immediately and issue a new one. Remove it from history with git filter-branch or BFG Repo-Cleaner."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Store secrets in a .env file and be sure to add it to .gitignore. In CI/CD, use environment variables or a secrets manager (AWS Secrets Manager, Vault and so on). If a secret has already been committed, revoke that key immediately and issue a new one. Remove it from the history with git filter-branch or BFG Repo-Cleaner."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : ".env 파일에 시크릿을 저장하고 .gitignore에 반드시 추가하세요. CI/CD에서는 환경 변수나 시크릿 매니저(AWS Secrets Manager, Vault 등)를 사용하세요. 이미 커밋된 시크릿이 있다면 즉시 해당 키를 폐기하고 새로 발급하세요. git filter-branch나 BFG Repo-Cleaner로 히스토리에서 삭제하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把密钥保存在 .env 文件里，并务必加入 .gitignore。CI/CD 中使用环境变量或密钥管理服务（AWS Secrets Manager、Vault 等）。如果已经提交过密钥，要立即作废该密钥并重新签发，再用 git filter-branch 或 BFG Repo-Cleaner 从历史中清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.025.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You internalize the importance of secret management and security awareness. The principle of never committing secrets to git is a security basic, and it grows into setting up automatic checks with pre-commit hooks."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You absorb the importance of secrets management and a security mindset. The principle of never committing secrets to git is a security basic, and it develops into setting up automatic checks with a pre-commit hook."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "시크릿 관리의 중요성과 보안 의식을 체화합니다. 'git에 절대 시크릿을 커밋하지 않는다'는 원칙은 보안의 기본이며, pre-commit hook으로 자동 검사를 설정하는 것까지 발전하게 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会真正建立密钥管理的重要性和安全意识。“绝不把密钥提交到 git”是安全的基本原则，还会进一步发展到用 pre-commit hook 设置自动检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
