    "mistake.027.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You work all day on top of yesterday's code, and when you go to push, a teammate has heavily modified the same file, causing a massive conflict. You spend hours more resolving conflicts on top of a day's work."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You work all day on top of yesterday's code, and when you go to push, a teammate has heavily changed the same files and you hit a massive conflict. You spend several extra hours resolving it on top of a full day's work."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "어제의 코드 위에서 하루 종일 작업했는데, 푸시하려 보니 다른 팀원이 같은 파일을 대폭 수정해서 대규모 충돌이 발생합니다. 하루 작업을 충돌 해결에 수 시간을 추가로 써야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在昨天的代码基础上干了一整天，推送时才发现同事大幅改动了同一个文件，发生大规模冲突。一天的工作，还得再花几个小时解决冲突。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.028.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Treat code review as a core part of your day. Start reviewing within 24 hours of a PR being opened. When reviewing, check the correctness of the logic, edge cases, security, performance, and readability. Mentioning good points too ('Nice abstraction here!') builds a positive review culture."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Treat code review as a core part of your working day. Start reviewing within 24 hours of a PR being raised. When reviewing, check correctness of logic, edge cases, security, performance and readability. Mention the good points too (\"nice abstraction here!\") and a positive review culture will form."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "코드 리뷰를 일과의 핵심 업무로 대하세요. PR이 올라오면 24시간 내에 리뷰를 시작하세요. 리뷰 시에는 로직의 정확성, 엣지 케이스, 보안, 성능, 가독성을 체크하세요. 좋은 점도 함께 언급하면('이 추상화 잘했네요!') 긍정적 리뷰 문화가 형성됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把代码评审当作日常工作的核心。PR 提交后 24 小时内开始评审。评审时检查逻辑正确性、边界情况、安全、性能和可读性。同时也提出优点（“这个抽象做得好！”），就能形成积极的评审文化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.028.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Code review goes beyond catching bugs. It's the most effective tool for raising the whole team's understanding of the code, sharing knowledge, and growing juniors. Becoming a good reviewer is a core developer skill too."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Code review goes beyond finding bugs: it is the most effective tool for improving the whole team's understanding of the code, sharing knowledge and helping juniors grow. Becoming a good reviewer is a core developer skill too."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "코드 리뷰는 버그 발견을 넘어 팀 전체의 코드 이해도를 높이고, 지식을 공유하며, 주니어를 성장시키는 가장 효과적인 도구입니다. 좋은 리뷰어가 되는 것도 핵심 개발자 역량입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代码评审不只是找 Bug，更是提升全团队对代码的理解、共享知识、培养新人的最有效工具。成为一名好的评审者，也是开发者的核心能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
