    "mistake.028.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a PR comes in, you don't look at the code closely and just leave an 'LGTM (Looks Good To Me),' or reviews pile up and sit untouched for three days. When a bug is found in code merged without a review, the whole team's time is consumed."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a PR comes in, you add \"LGTM\" (Looks Good To Me) without reading the code properly, or the reviews pile up and a PR is left sitting for three days. When a bug is found in code merged without a proper review, the whole team's time is used up."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "PR이 올라오면 코드를 자세히 보지 않고 'LGTM(Looks Good To Me)'을 달거나, 리뷰가 밀려서 3일째 방치합니다. 리뷰 없이 머지된 코드에서 버그가 발견되면 팀 전체의 시간이 소모됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PR 一来，不仔细看代码就回个“LGTM”（Looks Good To Me），或者评审积压，放了 3 天不管。没评审就合入的代码发现 Bug，会耗掉整个团队的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.029.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create and use a PR template: 1) motivation (why?), 2) what changed (what?), 3) how to test (how was it verified?), 4) screenshots (for UI changes), 5) things to watch out for. Respecting the reviewer's time is the secret to getting fast, good reviews."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create and use a PR template: 1) motivation for the change (why?), 2) what changed (what?), 3) how to test it (how was it verified?), 4) screenshots (for UI changes), 5) things to watch out for. Respecting the reviewer's time is the secret to getting fast, good reviews."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "PR 템플릿을 만들어 활용하세요: 1) 변경 동기(왜?), 2) 변경 내용(무엇을?), 3) 테스트 방법(어떻게 검증?), 4) 스크린샷(UI 변경 시), 5) 주의 사항. 리뷰어의 시간을 존중하는 것이 빠르고 좋은 리뷰를 받는 비결입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做一个 PR 模板并善加利用：1) 改动动机（为什么？）；2) 改动内容（改了什么？）；3) 测试方法（怎么验证？）；4) 截图（涉及 UI 改动时）；5) 注意事项。尊重评审者的时间，是获得快速、优质评审的秘诀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.029.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
