            "value" : "공유 브랜치를 rebase해서 문제가 생긴 경험이 있나요? 어떻게 해결했나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有没有因为对共享分支做 rebase 而出过问题？是怎么解决的？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.030.retro.3" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Which strategy does your team use, rebase or merge? Do you know why?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Does your team use rebase or merge? Do you know why?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "팀에서 rebase와 merge 중 어떤 전략을 사용하나요? 그 이유를 알고 있나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "团队用的是 rebase 还是 merge 策略？你知道原因吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.030.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How well do you understand how git works internally (the commit graph, HEAD, refs)?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How well do you understand how git works internally (the commit graph, HEAD, references)?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "git의 내부 동작(커밋 그래프, HEAD, 참조)을 어느 정도 이해하고 있나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你对 git 的内部原理（提交图、HEAD、引用）理解到什么程度？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.030.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A senior says 'rebase it,' so you run git rebase without knowing what it means, and the shared branch's history gets tangled and your teammates' work is thrown into chaos. Or unnecessary merge commits pile up and the history gets messy."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A senior colleague tells you to \"rebase\", so you run git rebase without knowing what it means, tangling the history of a shared branch and wrecking your teammates' work. Or unnecessary merge commits pile up and the history becomes complicated."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "선배가 'rebase 해'라고 해서 의미도 모르고 git rebase를 실행했다가, 공유 브랜치의 히스토리가 꼬여 팀원들의 작업이 엉망이 됩니다. 또는 불필요한 merge 커밋이 쌓여 히스토리가 복잡해집니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前辈说“你 rebase 一下”，你不明白意思就执行了 git rebase，结果共享分支的历史乱了套，同事的工作一团糟。或者堆了一堆不必要的 merge 提交，让历史变得复杂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Invest at least 30 minutes in design before coding. Sketch the main components, the data flow, and the key interfaces on paper or a whiteboard. Write the core logic in pseudocode first. For complex features, hold a design review with a teammate. The goal isn't a perfect design but getting the big direction right."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Invest at least 30 minutes in design before you code. Sketch the main components, the data flow and the key interfaces on paper or a whiteboard. Write the core logic in pseudocode first. For a complex feature, hold a design review with a teammate. The goal is not a perfect design but getting the big picture right."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "코딩 전에 최소 30분을 설계에 투자하세요. 종이나 화이트보드에 주요 컴포넌트, 데이터 흐름, 주요 인터페이스를 그려보세요. 의사코드(pseudocode)로 핵심 로직을 먼저 작성해보세요. 복잡한 기능이라면 팀원과 설계 리뷰를 하세요. 완벽한 설계가 아니라 '큰 방향'을 잡는 것이 목표입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写代码前至少花 30 分钟做设计。在纸上或白板上画出主要组件、数据流和主要接口。先用伪代码（pseudocode）写出核心逻辑。功能复杂的话，找同事一起做设计评审。目标不是完美的设计，而是确定“大方向”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build systems thinking. The habit of drawing the big picture first grows beyond the code level into product-level thinking. It's the first step toward becoming an architect."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You develop systems thinking. The habit of drawing the whole picture first grows beyond code-level thinking into product-level thinking. It is the first step towards becoming an architect."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "시스템적 사고(Systems Thinking) 능력을 기릅니다. 전체 그림을 먼저 그리는 습관은 코드 수준을 넘어 프로덕트 수준의 사고로 발전합니다. 아키텍트가 되는 첫걸음입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会培养系统性思维（Systems Thinking）。先画全局图的习惯，会从代码层面发展为产品层面的思考。这是成为架构师的第一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jumping straight into coding without any design"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starting to code without any design"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "설계 없이 바로 코딩을 시작한다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不做设计就直接开始写代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.retro.1" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Did you do any design before coding on your last feature? If so, how much time did you invest?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Did you do any design before coding on the last feature you built? If so, how much time did you spend?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "마지막 기능 개발 시 코딩 전에 설계를 했나요? 했다면 얼마나 시간을 투자했나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上一次开发功能时，写代码前做设计了吗？做了的话花了多少时间？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.retro.2" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Have you started without a design and had to change the structure significantly midway? What did it cost?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Have you ever started without a design and had to change the structure drastically halfway? What did it cost?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "설계 없이 시작해서 중간에 구조를 크게 바꿔야 했던 경험이 있나요? 어떤 비용이 들었나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有没有没做设计就开工，中途不得不大改结构的经历？付出了什么代价？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.retro.3" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has sketching the structure on a whiteboard or paper ever helped in actual development?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has sketching the structure on a whiteboard or paper ever helped in real development?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "화이트보드나 종이에 구조를 그려본 것이 실제 개발에 도움이 된 적이 있나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在白板或纸上画结构，有没有对实际开发起到过帮助？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Does your team have a culture of reviewing designs together? If not, what benefits would adopting it bring?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Does your team have a culture of reviewing designs together? If not, what would you gain by introducing one?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "팀원과 설계를 리뷰하는 문화가 있나요? 없다면 도입하면 어떤 이점이 있을까요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "团队里有一起评审设计的文化吗？如果没有，引入后会有什么好处？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.031.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The moment you get the requirements, you open the IDE and start coding. When you find a structural problem midway, you've already written so much code that it's hard to go back, and you keep adding workarounds until the code gets tangled."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You open your IDE and start coding the moment you receive the requirements. Even when you spot a structural problem midway, you've already written a lot of code, so it's hard to go back, and you keep adding workarounds until the code gets more and more tangled."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "요구사항을 받자마자 IDE를 열고 코딩을 시작합니다. 중간에 구조적 문제를 발견해도 이미 많은 코드를 작성했기 때문에 되돌리기 어렵고, 임시 방편(workaround)을 추가하다 코드가 점점 얽힙니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一拿到需求就打开 IDE 开始写。中途发现结构性问题，但已经写了太多代码，很难回头，只能不断加临时补丁（workaround），代码越缠越乱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.032.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Design for your current scale and the next six months of growth. A realistic approach is to start with a monolith and split out only the parts that become bottlenecks. Apply the YAGNI (You Aren't Gonna Need It) principle, and if you draw your module boundaries well, splitting later is easy."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Design for your current scale and the next six months of growth. Starting with a monolith and splitting out only the parts that become bottlenecks is the realistic approach. Apply the YAGNI (You Aren't Gonna Need It) principle, but if you get the module boundaries right, splitting things later is easy."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "현재 규모와 향후 6개월의 성장을 기준으로 설계하세요. 모놀리스로 시작해서 병목이 되는 부분만 분리하는 것이 현실적입니다. YAGNI(You Aren't Gonna Need It) 원칙을 적용하되, 모듈 경계만 잘 잡아두면 나중에 분리가 쉽습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以当前规模和未来 6 个月的增长为基准来设计。从单体起步，只把成为瓶颈的部分拆出去，才是现实的做法。遵循 YAGNI（You Aren't Gonna Need It）原则，只要把模块边界划好，以后拆分就容易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.032.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build the ability to judge the right level of abstraction. Balancing over-engineering and under-engineering is a core skill of experienced developers."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build the ability to judge the right level of abstraction. Striking the balance between over-engineering and under-engineering is a core skill of experienced developers."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "적절한 추상화 수준(Right Level of Abstraction)을 판단하는 능력을 기릅니다. 오버엔지니어링과 언더엔지니어링 사이의 균형을 잡는 것이 경험 있는 개발자의 핵심 역량입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会培养判断合适抽象层级（Right Level of Abstraction）的能力。在过度设计和设计不足之间取得平衡，是有经验的开发者的核心能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.032.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Designing an overly complex architecture from the start"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Designing an overly complex architecture from the start"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "처음부터 과도하게 복잡한 아키텍처를 설계한다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
