    "mistake.034.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A single UserManager class handles sign-up, login, profile editing, permission management, email sending, and even payment processing. The file runs past 3,000 lines, and since every change has to touch it, conflicts are frequent."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A single UserManager class handles sign-up, login, profile editing, permission management, sending emails and payment processing. The file runs past 3,000 lines, and because every change has to touch it, conflicts are constant."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "UserManager 하나의 클래스가 회원가입, 로그인, 프로필 수정, 권한 관리, 이메일 발송, 결제 처리까지 모두 담당합니다. 파일이 3000줄을 넘고, 어떤 변경이든 이 파일을 건드려야 해서 충돌이 빈발합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个 UserManager 类，同时负责注册、登录、修改资料、权限管理、发送邮件，甚至支付处理。文件超过 3000 行，任何改动都得碰这个文件，冲突频繁发生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.035.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Define an interface (protocol) and inject the implementation. Create a PaymentGateway interface and have StripeGateway and PayPalGateway implement it. Business logic depends only on the interface, so you can swap implementations freely. In tests, you can use a MockPaymentGateway."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Define an interface (protocol) and inject the implementation. Create a PaymentGateway interface and have StripeGateway and AdyenGateway implement it. Because the business logic depends only on the interface, you can swap implementations freely. In tests you can use a MockPaymentGateway."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "인터페이스(프로토콜)를 정의하고 구현체를 주입하세요. PaymentGateway 인터페이스를 만들고, KakaoPayGateway와 TossPayGateway가 이를 구현하게 하세요. 비즈니스 로직은 인터페이스에만 의존하므로, 구현체를 자유롭게 교체할 수 있습니다. 테스트에서는 MockPaymentGateway를 사용할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "定义接口（协议），并注入具体实现。创建 PaymentGateway 接口，让 WechatPayGateway 和 AlipayGateway 去实现它。业务逻辑只依赖接口，所以实现可以随意替换。测试时可以使用 MockPaymentGateway。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.035.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You internalize the Dependency Inversion Principle (DIP) and loose coupling. These are the foundation of testable code, flexible architecture, and plugin systems, and a core principle of large-scale system design."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You absorb the Dependency Inversion Principle (DIP) and loose coupling. These are the foundation of testable code, flexible architecture and plugin systems, and a core principle of designing large systems."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "의존성 역전 원칙(DIP)과 느슨한 결합(Loose Coupling)을 체득합니다. 이는 테스트 가능한 코드, 유연한 아키텍처, 플러그인 시스템의 기초이며, 대규모 시스템 설계의 핵심 원칙입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会真正掌握依赖倒置原则（DIP）和松耦合（Loose Coupling）。这是可测试代码、灵活架构和插件系统的基础，也是大型系统设计的核心原则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
