    "mistake.043.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You test only normal input and normal flow. You don't consider empty strings, null, negative numbers, maximum values, special characters, or concurrent access. In production, errors appear the moment a user enters something unexpected or uses the app on an unstable network."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You test only normal input and the normal flow. You don't consider empty strings, null, negative numbers, maximum values, special characters or concurrent access. In production, the moment users enter something unexpected or use the app on an unreliable network, errors appear."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "정상 입력, 정상 흐름만 테스트합니다. 빈 문자열, null, 음수, 최대값, 특수문자, 동시 접근 등은 고려하지 않습니다. 프로덕션에서 사용자가 예상 밖의 입력을 하거나, 네트워크가 불안정한 환경에서 사용하면 바로 에러가 발생합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只测试正常输入和正常流程，不考虑空字符串、null、负数、最大值、特殊字符、并发访问等。到了生产环境，用户一输入出乎意料的内容，或在网络不稳定的环境下使用，立刻就会出错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.044.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each test should be independent, verify one behavior, and always give the same result. Structure tests with the Given-When-Then pattern, and put the behavior being verified in the test name: test_discount_vip_members_get_15_percent. Mock external dependencies (DB, API) to isolate the test environment."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each test should be independent, check only one behaviour and always give the same result. Structure tests using the Given-When-Then pattern, and state the behaviour being verified in the test name: test_vip_member_gets_15_percent_discount. Mock external dependencies (databases, APIs) to isolate the test environment."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "각 테스트는 독립적이고, 하나의 동작만 검증하고, 항상 같은 결과를 내야 합니다. Given-When-Then 패턴으로 구조화하고, 테스트 이름에 검증하는 동작을 명시하세요: test_할인율_VIP_회원은_15퍼센트_적용. 외부 의존성(DB, API)은 모킹하여 테스트 환경을 격리하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个测试都应该独立，只验证一种行为，并且结果始终一致。用 Given-When-Then 模式组织结构，在测试名称里写明验证的行为：test_vip_member_gets_15_percent_discount。用 mock 隔离外部依赖（数据库、API），让测试环境独立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.044.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand that test code needs the same level of quality control as production code. Good tests are living documentation, a safety net for code changes, and a guarantee of team productivity."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand that test code needs the same level of quality control as production code. Good tests are living documentation, a safety net for code changes and a guarantee of the team's productivity."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "테스트 코드도 프로덕션 코드와 같은 수준의 품질 관리가 필요하다는 것을 이해합니다. 좋은 테스트는 살아있는 문서이자, 코드 변경의 안전망이며, 팀의 생산성을 보장합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会明白测试代码也需要与生产代码同等水平的质量管理。好的测试既是活文档，也是代码改动的安全网，还能保障团队的生产力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
