    "mistake.045.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unit tests for individual functions all pass, but the pieces don't work when connected. The auth module and the payment module each work fine, but there was a session management problem in the flow from login to payment."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every unit test for the individual functions passes, but the pieces don't work when connected for real. The authentication module and the payment module each work well on their own, yet there was a problem with session management in the flow from authentication to payment."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "개별 함수의 단위 테스트는 모두 통과하지만, 실제로 연동하면 동작하지 않습니다. 인증 모듈과 결제 모듈이 각각은 잘 돌지만, 인증 후 결제 흐름에서 세션 관리에 문제가 있었습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个函数的单元测试都通过了，可实际联调却不能工作。认证模块和支付模块各自运行良好，但认证后进入支付流程时，会话管理出了问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.046.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up a CI/CD pipeline with GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins, or similar. Have builds, tests, and linting run automatically on every push, and deploy automatically when code merges to main. Set up a quality gate that blocks merging when the pipeline fails."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up a CI/CD pipeline with GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins or similar. Make build, test and lint run automatically on every push, and deploy automatically when merging to main. Set up a quality gate that blocks merging when the pipeline fails."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins 등으로 CI/CD 파이프라인을 설정하세요. 코드 푸시 시 자동으로 빌드, 테스트, 린팅이 실행되고, main 머지 시 자동 배포가 되게 하세요. 파이프라인이 실패하면 머지가 차단되는 품질 게이트를 설정하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 GitHub Actions、GitLab CI、Jenkins 等搭建 CI/CD 流水线。推送代码时自动执行构建、测试和 Lint，合并到 main 时自动部署。设置质量门禁，流水线失败就禁止合并。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.046.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You feel the power of automation. CI/CD is the basic infrastructure of modern development, and an environment where everything is verified and deployed automatically when you push code maximizes developer productivity and confidence."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You feel the power of automation. CI/CD is basic infrastructure for modern development, and an environment where everything is verified and deployed automatically when you push code maximises a developer's productivity and confidence."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "자동화의 힘을 체감합니다. CI/CD는 현대 개발의 기본 인프라이며, '코드를 푸시하면 모든 것이 자동으로 검증되고 배포된다'는 환경이 개발자의 생산성과 자신감을 극대화합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会切身体会到自动化的力量。CI/CD 是现代开发的基础设施，“推送代码后，一切自动验证并部署”的环境，能最大限度提升开发者的生产力和信心。"
          }
