    },
    "mistake.048.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After development is done, you run your first performance test just before launch. Response time is 10 seconds, and the server goes down at 50 concurrent users. It's an architecture-level problem that can't be fixed by the deadline, and the launch gets postponed."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You run performance tests for the first time after development is finished, just before release. Response times are 10 seconds and the server goes down at 50 concurrent users. Because it's an architecture-level problem, it can't be fixed in time and the release is postponed."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "기능 개발이 끝나고 출시 전에 처음으로 성능 테스트를 합니다. 응답 시간이 10초, 동시 접속 50명에서 서버가 다운됩니다. 아키텍처 수준의 문제여서 기한 내 수정이 불가능하고, 출시가 연기됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功能开发完，上线前才第一次做性能测试。响应时间达到 10 秒，50 个并发用户就让服务器宕机。问题出在架构层面，无法在期限内修复，上线被推迟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.049.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Focus on the quality of tests rather than the coverage number. Concentrate on core business logic, complex conditional branches, and error handling paths. 80% coverage achieved with good tests is worth more than 100% coverage padded with meaningless ones."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Focus on the quality of your tests rather than the coverage figure. Concentrate on the core business logic, complicated conditional branches and error-handling paths. 80% coverage achieved with good tests is worth more than 100% padded out with pointless ones."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "커버리지 숫자보다 테스트의 질에 집중하세요. 핵심 비즈니스 로직, 복잡한 조건 분기, 에러 처리 경로에 집중하세요. 80% 커버리지가 좋은 테스트로 달성된 것이 100% 커버리지가 무의미한 테스트로 채워진 것보다 가치 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关注测试的质量，而非覆盖率数字。重点覆盖核心业务逻辑、复杂的条件分支和错误处理路径。用好测试达到 80% 覆盖率，比用无意义的测试堆出 100% 更有价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.049.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build the ability to tell a metric from a goal. Coverage is a useful metric, but when it becomes the goal itself, it drives distorted behavior (mass-producing meaningless tests). This is a classic example of Goodhart's law."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build the ability to tell a metric from a goal. Coverage is a useful metric, but once it becomes the goal itself it distorts behaviour (churning out meaningless tests). This is a textbook example of Goodhart's law."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지표와 목표를 구분하는 능력을 기릅니다. 커버리지는 유용한 지표이지만, 그 자체가 목표가 되면 왜곡된 행동(무의미한 테스트 양산)을 유발합니다. 이는 Goodhart의 법칙의 전형적인 예입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会培养区分指标和目标的能力。覆盖率是有用的指标，但一旦变成目标本身，就会引发扭曲的行为（大量产出无意义的测试）。这是古德哈特定律的典型例子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.049.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
