    "mistake.050.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A test fails and the cause is hard to pin down, so you mark it @Disabled or comment it out. Over time, dozens of disabled tests pile up, the guarantee that the feature works disappears, and trust in the whole test suite collapses."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A test fails and the cause is hard to find, so you disable it with @Disabled or a comment. Over time dozens of disabled tests pile up, the guarantee that the feature works disappears, and trust in the whole test suite collapses."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "테스트가 실패하는데 원인 파악이 어려워 @Disabled나 주석으로 처리합니다. 시간이 지나면 비활성화된 테스트가 수십 개 쌓이고, 해당 기능의 동작 보장이 사라지며, 테스트 스위트 전체의 신뢰도가 무너집니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试失败，又难以查明原因，就用 @Disabled 或注释屏蔽。时间一长，被禁用的测试积累了几十个，相应功能的行为失去保障，整个测试套件的可信度也崩塌了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.051.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go deep on your main language, but try a language from a different paradigm each year. Experiencing other perspectives, such as functional (Haskell, Elixir), scripting (Python), and systems (Rust), helps you use your main language better too. Understanding the full stack a little at a time greatly improves your ability to collaborate."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go deep in your main language, but sample a language from a different paradigm each year. Experiencing other viewpoints, such as functional (Haskell, Elixir), scripting (Python) or systems (Rust), will help you use your main language better too. Understanding the full stack a little at a time greatly improves how well you collaborate."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "주력 언어를 깊게 파되, 1년에 하나씩 다른 패러다임의 언어를 맛보세요. 함수형(Haskell, Elixir), 스크립트(Python), 시스템(Rust) 등 다른 관점을 경험하면 주력 언어도 더 잘 쓸 수 있게 됩니다. 전체 스택을 조금씩 이해하면 협업 능력이 크게 향상됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "深耕主力语言的同时，每年尝试一门不同范式的语言。函数式（Haskell、Elixir）、脚本（Python）、系统级（Rust）等，体验不同的视角，反过来也能把主力语言用得更好。对整个技术栈都有一点了解，协作能力会大幅提升。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.051.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
