    "mistake.053.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You only learn how to use frameworks and never study basic computer science. You can't understand why things slow down as data grows, and without the foundational knowledge to handle memory issues or concurrency problems, you can't solve problems at the root."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn how to use frameworks but never study basic computer science. You can't understand why things slow down as the data grows, and without the foundations to deal with memory issues or concurrency problems, you can't get to the root of the problem."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "프레임워크 사용법만 익히고 기초 컴퓨터 과학을 공부하지 않습니다. 데이터가 늘어나면 왜 느려지는지 이해할 수 없고, 메모리 이슈나 동시성 문제를 해결할 기초 지식이 없어 근본적인 문제 해결이 안 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只学会了框架怎么用，没学计算机基础。不明白数据增多后为什么会变慢，遇到内存问题或并发问题时没有基础知识，无法从根本上解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.054.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set criteria for choosing technology: 1) Does it solve our current problem better? 2) Does the team have room to learn it? 3) Are the community and support sufficient? 4) Can it still be maintained five years from now? Decide by fit to the problem, not by hype. Try new technology out on a side project first."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set criteria for choosing technology: 1) does it solve the current problem better? 2) does the team have room to learn it? 3) are the community and support strong enough? 4) will it still be maintainable in five years? Judge by how well it fits the problem, not by fashion. Try out new technology in a side project first."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "기술 선택 기준을 세우세요: 1) 현재 문제를 더 잘 해결하는가?, 2) 팀이 학습할 여유가 있는가?, 3) 커뮤니티와 지원이 충분한가?, 4) 5년 후에도 유지보수 가능한가? 유행이 아니라 문제 적합성으로 판단하세요. 새 기술은 사이드 프로젝트에서 먼저 검증하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建立技术选型标准：1) 它能更好地解决当前问题吗？2) 团队有余力学习吗？3) 社区和支持足够吗？4) 五年后还能维护吗？以适不适合解决问题为依据，而不是看流行与否。新技术先在个人项目里验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.054.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build technical decision-making skills. You realize that deep understanding of proven technology is worth more than shallow experience with new ones. This is a key quality for growing into a tech lead."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You build the ability to make technical decisions. You realise that a deep understanding of proven technology is worth more than shallow experience of new ones. This is an essential quality for growing into a technical leader."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "기술적 의사결정(Technical Decision Making) 능력을 기릅니다. 검증된 기술의 깊은 이해가 새 기술의 얕은 경험보다 가치 있다는 것을 깨닫게 됩니다. 이는 기술 리더로 성장하는 데 핵심적인 자질입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会培养技术决策（Technical Decision Making）能力，并明白对成熟技术的深入理解，比对新技术的浅尝辄止更有价值。这是成长为技术负责人的关键素质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
