    "mistake.054.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every time a new framework shows up on Hacker News, you want to migrate your existing project. You tell the team 'We should use X too,' but your current stack solves the problem well enough, and the new technology's community and ecosystem are still immature."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every time a new framework appears on Hacker News, you want to migrate your existing project. You tell the team \"we should be using X too\", but the current stack solves the problem perfectly well, and the new technology's community and ecosystem are still immature."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "새 프레임워크가 Hacker News에 올라올 때마다 기존 프로젝트를 마이그레이션하려 합니다. 팀에 '우리도 X를 써야 한다'고 주장하지만, 현재 스택이 충분히 문제를 해결하고 있고, 새 기술의 커뮤니티와 생태계는 아직 미성숙합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次 Hacker News 上出现新框架，就想把现有项目迁移过去。向团队主张“我们也该用 X”，可现有技术栈完全能解决问题，而新技术的社区和生态还不成熟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.055.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Join local developer meetups, online communities (Discord, Slack), and conferences. At first, just listening is fine. Try making a small contribution to open source, starting with fixing a typo in the docs. Start a tech blog and connect with other developers on social media. Start a developer study group around you."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take part in local developer meetups, online communities (Discord, Slack) and conferences. At first it's fine just to listen. Try making a small contribution to open source, starting with fixing a typo in the documentation. Start a tech blog and talk with other developers on social media. Start a developer study group among people around you."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지역 개발자 밋업, 온라인 커뮤니티(Discord, Slack), 컨퍼런스에 참여하세요. 처음에는 듣기만 해도 됩니다. 오픈소스에 작은 기여(문서 오타 수정부터)를 해보세요. 기술 블로그를 시작하고 SNS에서 다른 개발자와 교류하세요. 주변에 개발자 스터디를 만들어보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "参加本地的开发者聚会、线上社区（Discord、Slack）和技术大会。刚开始光听也行。给开源项目做点小贡献（从改文档里的错别字开始）。开始写技术博客，在社交平台上和其他开发者交流。也可以在身边组织开发者学习小组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.055.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The insight, network, and motivation you get from a community are hard to get from self-study. Learning from other people's experience cuts down on trial and error, and different perspectives broaden your view."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The insights, network and motivation you gain from a community are hard to get from self-study. Learning from other people's experience cuts down on trial and error, and different viewpoints broaden your outlook."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "커뮤니티에서 얻는 인사이트, 네트워크, 동기부여는 독학으로 얻기 어렵습니다. 다른 사람의 경험에서 배우면 시행착오를 줄일 수 있고, 다양한 관점이 시야를 넓혀줍니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "社区里的见解、人脉和动力，靠自学很难得到。从别人的经验中学习，能少走弯路，不同的视角也能拓宽视野。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
