    "mistake.056.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You take a Udemy course and type along, and it works, but when the course ends you can't build anything on your own. You fall into Tutorial Hell, where you can't write a single line without searching."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You take courses on Udemy and similar sites, and what you type along with the instructor works, but once the course is over you can't build anything by yourself. You fall into tutorial hell, unable to write a single line without searching."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "유데미, 인프런의 강의를 수강하고 따라 치면 동작하지만, 강의가 끝나면 스스로 아무것도 만들 수 없습니다. 검색 없이는 한 줄도 작성하지 못하는 '튜토리얼 지옥(Tutorial Hell)'에 빠집니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "听慕课网、B 站上的课程，跟着敲代码能跑，课一结束却什么都做不出来。没有搜索就写不出一行，陷入“教程地狱”（Tutorial Hell）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.057.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Say honestly, 'I'm not sure, could you explain a bit more?' or 'I don't have experience with this, so I'd need some guidance.' Admitting you don't know isn't a weakness; it's the start of learning, and most seniors trust honest juniors more and are eager to help them."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Be honest and say, \"I'm not sure about this; could you explain a bit more?\" or \"I haven't any experience with this part, so I need some guidance.\" Admitting you don't know something is not a weakness but the start of learning, and most seniors trust an honest junior more and are keen to help."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "'잘 모르겠는데 좀 더 설명해주실 수 있나요?', '이 부분은 경험이 없어서 가이드가 필요합니다'라고 솔직하게 말하세요. 모르는 것을 인정하는 것은 약점이 아니라 학습의 시작이며, 대부분의 시니어는 솔직한 주니어를 더 신뢰하고 적극적으로 도와줍니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "坦率地说：“我不太明白，能再详细讲讲吗？”“这部分我没有经验，需要一些指导。”承认不懂不是弱点，而是学习的开始，大多数资深开发者更信任、也更愿意帮助坦诚的新人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.057.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intellectual humility is the best attitude for learning. People who quickly admit what they don't know and learn grow much faster than those who bluff and miss opportunities."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intellectual humility is the best attitude to learning. People who quickly admit what they don't know and learn grow far faster than those who bluff and miss their chance."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지적 겸손(Intellectual Humility)은 최고의 학습 태도입니다. 모르는 것을 빠르게 인정하고 배우는 사람이 아는 척하다 기회를 놓치는 사람보다 훨씬 빠르게 성장합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智识上的谦逊（Intellectual Humility）是最好的学习态度。能很快承认不懂并去学习的人，比假装懂而错失机会的人成长快得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.057.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not being able to say 'I don't know'"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not being able to say you don't know something"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "모르는 것을 모른다고 말하지 못한다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不懂的东西不敢说不懂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.057.retro.1" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Have you recently said honestly that you didn't know something? How did the other person react?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Have you recently said honestly \"I don't know\"? How did the other person react?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "최근 '모르겠다'고 솔직하게 말한 경험이 있나요? 상대방의 반응은 어땠나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
