    "mistake.060.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You work late every night, code on weekends, and repeat nothing but 'work harder.' Your focus gradually slips, your code quality drops, and development stops being fun, but you can't stop."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You work late every day, code at weekends and just repeat \"work harder\". Your concentration gradually slips, your code quality falls and development itself stops being enjoyable, yet you can't stop."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "매일 야근하고, 주말에도 코딩하며, '더 열심히'만 반복합니다. 점점 집중력이 떨어지고, 코드 품질이 하락하고, 개발 자체가 즐겁지 않아지지만 멈출 수가 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天加班，周末也写代码，只会重复“更努力”。注意力越来越差，代码质量下降，连开发本身都不再有乐趣，却停不下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.061.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the daily standup, share what you did yesterday, what you'll do today, and what's blocking you. For big tasks, post a progress update in Slack once a day. Be specific, like '70% done, working on the payment integration, found an issue with the API response format.' Transparency of information raises your team's efficiency."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the daily stand-up, share what you did yesterday, what you will do today and what is blocking you. For big pieces of work, post a progress update in Slack once a day. Be specific, for example: \"70% done, working on the payment integration, found an issue with the API response format\". Transparency of information makes the team more efficient."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "데일리 스탠드업에서 '어제 한 일, 오늘 할 일, 막히는 것'을 공유하세요. 큰 작업은 하루에 한 번 진행 상황을 슬랙에 업데이트하세요. '70% 완료, 결제 연동 진행 중, API 응답 포맷 이슈 발견'처럼 구체적으로 공유하세요. 정보의 투명성이 팀의 효율을 높입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每日站会上分享“昨天做了什么、今天要做什么、遇到什么阻碍”。大任务每天在 Slack 上更新一次进展。具体地分享，比如“完成 70%，正在对接支付，发现 API 响应格式有问题”。信息透明能提高团队的效率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.061.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn the basics of project management and communication. Transparent communication builds team trust, catches problems early, and reduces waste."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn the basics of project management and communication. Transparent communication builds trust in the team, catches problems early and reduces waste."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "프로젝트 관리와 커뮤니케이션의 기본을 배웁니다. 투명한 소통은 팀의 신뢰를 구축하고, 문제를 조기에 발견하며, 낭비를 줄입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
