      }
    },
    "mistake.061.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You work quietly alone and then say 'It's almost done' the day before the deadline. But the team never got to tell you the direction changed three days ago, and half your work was unnecessary. Or another teammate was doing the same work in parallel."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You work quietly on your own, then say \"it's nearly done\" the day before the deadline. But the team never got to tell you that the direction changed three days ago, and half your work was unnecessary. Or another teammate was doing the same task in parallel."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "조용히 혼자 작업하다가 마감 전날 '거의 다 됐어요'라고 말합니다. 하지만 팀은 3일 전에 방향이 바뀐 것을 알려주지 못했고, 작업의 절반이 불필요한 것이었습니다. 또는 다른 팀원이 같은 작업을 중복으로 하고 있었습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默默一个人干活，到截止前一天才说“快好了”。但团队没能在三天前告诉你方向已经变了，导致一半的工作是多余的。或者别的同事一直在重复做同样的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.062.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apply the 15-minute rule: if you've made no progress in 15 minutes, ask for help. When you ask, don't just say 'It doesn't work.' Share what you tried, where you got stuck, and what hypothesis you have. That lets seniors help you more effectively."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apply the 15-minute rule: if you've made no progress after 15 minutes, ask for help. But when you ask, don't just say \"it doesn't work\"; share what you tried, where you got stuck and what hypotheses you have, such as \"I tried this, I'm stuck here, and I think it might be this\". That way a senior can help far more effectively."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "15분 규칙을 적용하세요: 15분 이상 진전이 없으면 도움을 구하세요. 다만, 도움을 구할 때는 '안 돼요'가 아니라 '이것을 시도했고, 이 부분에서 막혔는데, 이런 가설을 세우고 있습니다'처럼 본인의 시도와 생각을 함께 전달하세요. 이러면 시니어도 더 효과적으로 도울 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遵循 15 分钟规则：超过 15 分钟没有进展，就去求助。但求助时不要只说“不行”，而要连同自己的尝试和想法一起说明，比如“我试了这些，卡在这个地方，我的假设是这样”。这样资深同事也能更有效地帮你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.062.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Effective help-seeking is a core professional skill. Asking for help at the right time raises the team's total productivity, and sometimes organizing your problem to ask the question leads you to the answer yourself (rubber duck debugging)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Effective help-seeking is a core professional skill. Asking for help at the right time raises the team's total productivity, and sometimes working the problem out as you put the question together leads you to the answer yourself (rubber duck debugging)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "효율적 도움 요청(Effective Help-seeking) 능력은 핵심 직무 역량입니다. 적시에 도움을 구하면 팀의 총 생산성이 높아지며, 질문하는 과정에서 문제를 정리하다 스스로 답을 찾기도 합니다(러버 덕 디버깅)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有效求助（Effective Help-seeking）能力是一项核心职业能力。及时求助能提高团队的整体效率，而且在整理问题、提问的过程中，你自己也可能找到答案（小黄鸭调试）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.062.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Struggling alone for days with a stuck problem and not asking for help"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
