    },
    "mistake.063.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a new teammate joins, how long does it take to get them up to speed on the technical context?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a new teammate joins, how long does it take to get them up to speed on the technical context?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "새 팀원이 합류했을 때 기술적 맥락을 이해시키는 데 얼마나 시간이 걸리나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新同事加入时，让他理解技术背景需要多长时间？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.063.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Why you chose PostgreSQL, why you used GraphQL instead of REST, why you adopted a particular library: none of it is written down. Six months later nobody can answer 'Why are we using this?' and the same discussion happens all over again."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nobody writes down why PostgreSQL was chosen, why GraphQL was used instead of REST, or why a particular library was adopted. Six months later nobody can answer \"why are we using this?\" and the same discussions come round again."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "PostgreSQL을 선택한 이유, REST 대신 GraphQL을 쓴 이유, 특정 라이브러리를 도입한 이유가 기록되지 않습니다. 6개월 후 '왜 이걸 쓰고 있지?'라는 질문에 아무도 대답할 수 없고, 같은 논의가 반복됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为什么选 PostgreSQL，为什么用 GraphQL 而不是 REST，为什么引入某个库，都没有记录。半年后问“我们为什么用这个？”，没人答得上来，同样的讨论还会再来一遍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read the agenda before the meeting and prepare at least one question or opinion. A confirming question like 'Is my understanding correct that...?' works well too. A junior's 'Why do we do it this way?' often exposes a blind spot the team has missed. Speaking up is both presence and a chance to grow."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read the agenda before the meeting and prepare at least one question or comment. A checking question like \"my understanding is X, is that right?\" is a good one. A junior's question of \"why are we doing it this way?\" often exposes a blind spot the team has missed. Speaking up is both a way to be noticed and a chance to grow."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "회의 전에 안건을 미리 읽고 질문이나 의견을 하나 이상 준비하세요. '제가 이해한 바로는 ~인데 맞나요?'라는 확인 질문도 좋습니다. 주니어의 '왜 이렇게 하나요?'라는 질문이 팀이 놓친 맹점을 드러내는 경우가 많습니다. 발언은 존재감이자 성장 기회입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开会前先读议程，准备至少一个问题或意见。“我的理解是……，对吗？”这种确认式的提问也很好。新人一句“为什么这样做？”，常常能戳中团队忽略的盲点。发言既是存在感，也是成长的机会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The habit of active participation accelerates your career growth. Speaking in meetings builds your communication skills, helps you understand the business context, and is practice at contributing to decisions."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The habit of taking an active part accelerates your career growth. Speaking in meetings builds communication skills, helps you understand the business context and gives you practice at contributing to decisions."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "주도적인 참여(Active Participation) 습관이 커리어 성장을 가속화합니다. 회의에서 발언하는 것은 소통 능력을 키우고, 비즈니스 맥락을 이해하며, 의사결정에 기여하는 연습입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主动参与（Active Participation）的习惯会加速你的职业成长。在会议上发言，是锻炼沟通能力、理解业务背景、参与决策的练习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Never saying anything in meetings"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saying nothing at all in meetings"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "회의에서 아무 발언도 하지 않는다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开会时一言不发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.retro.1" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How many times did you speak in your last meeting? Was it a meaningful contribution?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How many times did you speak in your last meeting? Was it a meaningful contribution?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지난 회의에서 발언을 몇 번 했나요? 의미 있는 기여였나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次开会你发言了几次？是有价值的贡献吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.retro.2" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Have you had a question or opinion and not voiced it? Why did you stay silent?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
