            "value" : "你有开会前提前读议程并做准备的习惯吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has a junior's question ever exposed a blind spot on the team? (yours or another junior's)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has a junior's question ever exposed a blind spot in the team? (Yours or another junior's)"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "주니어의 질문이 팀의 맹점을 드러낸 경험이 있나요? (본인 또는 다른 주니어)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有没有新人的提问暴露了团队盲点的经历？（自己或其他新人的）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.064.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even when you don't understand something, you don't ask, and even when you have an opinion, you don't share it. After the meeting you mull it over alone and end up working in the wrong direction. You lose your presence on the team, and your input doesn't shape important decisions."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even when there's something you don't understand, you don't ask, and even when you have an opinion, you don't voice it. After the meeting you puzzle it over alone and end up working in the wrong direction. You fade into the background in the team, and your views aren't reflected in important decisions."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "이해가 안 되는 부분이 있어도 질문하지 않고, 의견이 있어도 말하지 않습니다. 회의 후 혼자 고민하다 엉뚱한 방향으로 작업합니다. 팀에서 존재감이 없어지고, 중요한 결정에서 의견이 반영되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有不明白的地方也不问，有想法也不说。会后一个人琢磨，结果朝着错误的方向干活。在团队里没有存在感，重要的决定里也听不到你的意见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.065.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Explain at the other person's level. 'Right now payment processing is slow, so users wait two or three seconds. If we move payment processing to the background, users see the confirmation screen right away. It will take about a week.' Use analogies. 'Right now it's like standing at the counter waiting until your food is ready. With the improvement, you get a buzzer and can sit down.'"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Explain at the other person's level. \"Payment processing is currently slow, so users wait two to three seconds. If we move payment processing to the background, users will see the confirmation screen straight away. It will take about a week.\" Use analogies: \"At the moment it's like standing at the counter in a restaurant until your meal is ready; after the improvement, you get a buzzer and can sit down at a table.\""
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "상대방의 수준에 맞춰 설명하세요. '현재 결제 처리가 느려서 사용자가 2~3초 기다려야 합니다. 결제 처리를 백그라운드로 옮기면 사용자는 바로 확인 화면을 볼 수 있습니다. 약 1주일 소요됩니다.' 비유를 활용하세요. '현재는 레스토랑에서 요리가 다 될 때까지 서서 기다리는 것이고, 개선하면 진동벨을 받고 자리에 앉아 있을 수 있는 것입니다.'"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据对方的水平来解释。“现在支付处理比较慢，用户要等 2~3 秒。把支付处理挪到后台，用户就能马上看到确认页面。大约需要 1 周。”善用比喻：“现在好比在餐厅站着等菜做好，改进后就像拿个取餐号，坐着等就行。”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.065.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Technical communication skill determines a developer's influence. You need to be able to persuade non-developers to win the resources and support for technical decisions."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Technical communication skills determine a developer's influence. Only if you can persuade non-developers can you win resources and support for technical decisions."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "기술적 커뮤니케이션(Technical Communication) 능력은 개발자의 영향력을 결정합니다. 비개발자를 설득할 수 있어야 기술적 결정에 자원과 지지를 얻을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "技术沟通（Technical Communication）能力决定开发者的影响力。能说服非技术人员，技术决策才能获得资源和支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.065.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Explaining things to non-developers using only technical terms"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Explaining things to non-developers using only technical terms"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "비개발자에게 기술 용어로만 설명한다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对非技术人员只会用技术术语解释"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.065.retro.1" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you explain technical things to non-developers, are you confident they understood?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
