    },
    "mistake.067.retro.3" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before implementing, do you agree with the product manager or designer on the scope of the feature?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before implementing, do you agree with the product manager or designer where the scope of the feature ends?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "구현 전 '이 기능의 범위는 여기까지'라고 기획자/디자이너와 합의하는 과정이 있나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实现前，有没有和产品/设计确认“这个功能的范围到这里”的过程？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.067.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you have a habit of asking questions while looking at a wireframe or mockup?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you have a habit of asking questions while looking at wireframes or mock-ups?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "와이어프레임이나 목업을 보면서 질문을 던지는 습관이 있나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你有边看线框图或原型边提问的习惯吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.067.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Given the request 'Please build a user search feature,' you start coding right away. When you show it off, the feedback pours in: 'We wanted a search button, not real-time autocomplete,' and 'It should search by email, not just name.' You have to start over."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You start coding straight away on a request to \"build a user search feature\". When you show it off, the feedback pours in: \"we meant a search button, not live autocomplete\", \"it needs to search by email as well as name\", and you have to rebuild it from scratch."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "'사용자 검색 기능을 만들어주세요'라는 요청에 바로 코딩을 시작합니다. 완성 후 보여주니 '실시간 자동완성이 아니라 검색 버튼 클릭 방식이었는데요', '이름뿐 아니라 이메일로도 검색되어야 하는데요' 같은 피드백이 쏟아져 처음부터 다시 만들어야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接到“做一个用户搜索功能”的需求，立刻开始写代码。做完一演示，反馈接踵而至：“我们要的是点搜索按钮才搜，不是实时联想”“不光按名字，还要能按邮箱搜”，只好从头再做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.068.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The worse the news, the sooner you should share it. Presenting an alternative along with the problem makes a much better impression: 'We're going to be two days late because of issue X. I'm trying Y, and if that doesn't work, I'll look at option Z.' The sooner you share a problem, the more solution options you have and the more help you can get from the team."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The worse the news, the sooner you should share it. Offering an alternative along with the problem, such as \"we're likely to be two days late because of issue X; I'm trying Y, and if that doesn't work I'll look at option Z\", makes a far better impression. The sooner you share a problem, the more options you have for solving it and the more help you can get from the team."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "나쁜 소식일수록 빨리 공유하세요. '현재 X 이슈로 2일 지연될 것 같습니다. Y를 시도 중이고, 해결이 안 되면 Z 방안을 검토하겠습니다.'처럼 문제와 함께 대안을 제시하면 훨씬 좋은 인상을 줍니다. 문제를 빨리 공유할수록 해결 옵션이 많고, 팀의 도움을 받을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越是坏消息，越要早点同步。像“目前因为 X 问题，预计会延后 2 天。我正在尝试 Y，如果解决不了，会考虑 Z 方案”这样，带着方案说明问题，印象会好得多。问题同步得越早，可选的解决办法就越多，也能得到团队的帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.068.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transparent communication is a sign of professionalism. A culture of sharing problems quickly and solving them together, instead of hiding them, marks a healthy team, and the people who build that culture become leaders."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transparent communication is a sign of professionalism. A culture of sharing problems quickly and solving them together marks a healthy team, and the people who create that culture become leaders."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "투명한 커뮤니케이션은 전문성의 표현입니다. 문제를 숨기는 것보다 빠르게 공유하고 함께 해결하는 문화가 건강한 팀의 특징이며, 이런 문화를 만드는 사람이 리더가 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透明沟通是专业性的体现。比起隐瞒问题，尽快分享并一起解决的文化，是健康团队的特征，营造这种文化的人会成为领导者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.068.mistake" : {
