    },
    "mistake.068.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The schedule is slipping, but you report that everything is going well. By the time the problem has grown too big to hide and you share it, the team has too little time to respond and the damage is bigger. The reaction is, 'Why didn't you tell us sooner?'"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The schedule is slipping, but you report \"it's going well\". By the time the problem has grown too big to hide and you share it, the team has too little time to react and the damage is greater. You get the reaction, \"why didn't you tell us sooner?\""
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "일정이 밀리고 있는데 '잘 되고 있습니다'라고 보고합니다. 문제가 커져서 더 이상 숨길 수 없을 때 공유하면, 팀이 대응할 시간이 부족하여 피해가 커집니다. '왜 더 일찍 말하지 않았어?'라는 반응을 받습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "进度已经落后了，却汇报“进展顺利”。等问题大到瞒不住了才说，团队已来不及应对，损失更大。得到的反应是“你怎么不早点说？”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.069.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look for the strengths in the other person's idea first. Say, 'I like X about that approach, but I'd like to suggest mine for Y reasons.' Talk with the assumption that you could be wrong, and ask the other person, 'In what situations would your approach work better?' The best solutions come from the collision of multiple perspectives."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First look for the strengths in the other person's view. Say, \"I like X about your approach, but I'd like to suggest mine in terms of Y.\" Talk on the assumption that you might be wrong, and ask the other person, \"in what situations would your approach be better?\" The best solutions come from the clash of different viewpoints."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "상대 의견의 장점을 먼저 찾으세요. '그 방법의 X는 좋은데, Y 측면에서 제 방법을 제안하고 싶습니다'라고 말하세요. '내가 틀릴 수 있다'는 전제로 대화하고, 상대에게 '어떤 상황에서 당신의 방법이 더 좋을까요?'라고 물어보세요. 최고의 해결책은 여러 관점의 충돌에서 나옵니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先找出对方意见中的优点。可以这样说：“你这个方法里的 X 很好，不过从 Y 的角度，我想提出我的方案。”带着“我可能是错的”这个前提去交流，并问对方：“在什么情况下，你的方法会更好？”最好的解决方案，往往来自多种观点的碰撞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.069.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ability to debate constructively raises the quality of your team's decisions. Developers who listen write better code, and the ability to integrate different perspectives is at the core of leadership."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ability to debate constructively raises the quality of the team's decisions. Developers who listen write better code, and the ability to bring different viewpoints together is the heart of leadership."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "건설적 토론(Constructive Debate) 능력은 팀의 의사결정 품질을 높입니다. 경청하는 개발자가 더 좋은 코드를 작성하며, 다양한 관점을 통합하는 능력이 리더십의 핵심입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建设性讨论（Constructive Debate）的能力会提高团队的决策质量。会倾听的开发者写出更好的代码，整合不同观点的能力是领导力的核心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.069.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pushing only your own opinion and not listening to other views"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Insisting on your own opinion and not listening to other views"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
