    "mistake.073.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You only learn about an outage after a user contacts support to say, 'The app is down.' Even with a 50% error rate, without server monitoring the dev team has no idea. It takes an hour to notice the outage and another two hours to find the cause."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You only find out about an outage after a user contacts support to say \"the app isn't working\". Even with a 50% error rate, without server monitoring the development team knows nothing. It takes an hour to notice the outage and another two to find the cause."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "사용자가 '앱이 안 됩니다'라고 고객센터에 연락한 후에야 장애를 인지합니다. 에러율이 50%여도 서버 모니터링이 없으니 개발팀은 아무것도 모릅니다. 장애 인지까지 1시간, 원인 파악에 추가 2시간이 걸립니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直到用户联系客服说“App 用不了”，才知道出了故障。就算错误率有 50%，没有服务器监控，开发团队也一无所知。发现故障要 1 小时，查明原因还要再 2 小时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.074.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use structured logs (JSON format): { timestamp, level, message, userId, action, requestId, error }. Give every request a unique ID (correlation ID) so you can trace the flow of a single request. Never put sensitive information (passwords, card numbers) in logs."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use structured logs (in JSON format): { timestamp, level, message, userId, action, requestId, error }. Give each request a unique ID (a correlation ID) so you can trace the flow of a single request. Never put sensitive information (passwords, card numbers) in logs."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "구조화된 로그(JSON 형식)를 사용하세요: { timestamp, level, message, userId, action, requestId, error }. 요청마다 고유 ID(correlation ID)를 부여해 하나의 요청 흐름을 추적할 수 있게 하세요. 민감 정보(비밀번호, 카드 번호)는 절대 로그에 남기지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用结构化日志（JSON 格式）：{ timestamp, level, message, userId, action, requestId, error }。给每个请求分配唯一 ID（correlation ID），以便追踪一次请求的完整流程。敏感信息（密码、银行卡号）绝对不要写进日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.074.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You lay the foundation for root cause analysis during incidents. A good log is a flashlight in the dark, and it dramatically shortens the time to resolve production issues."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You lay the foundations for root cause analysis during an incident. Good logs are a torch in the dark, and they dramatically shorten the time to resolve production issues."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "장애 상황에서의 원인 추적(Root Cause Analysis) 능력의 기반을 만듭니다. 좋은 로그는 '어둠 속의 손전등'이며, 프로덕션 이슈 해결 시간을 극적으로 단축합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会打下故障时根因分析（Root Cause Analysis）能力的基础。好的日志就像“黑暗中的手电筒”，能大幅缩短解决生产问题的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.074.mistake" : {
