    },
    "mistake.074.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In production, a particular user's payment fails. But the log says only 'Error occurred,' and you can't tell which user, which payment info, or at which step it failed. Tracing the cause is impossible."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A particular user's payment fails in production. But the log says only \"Error occurred\", and you can't tell which user, which payment details or at which step it failed. Tracing the cause is impossible."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "프로덕션에서 특정 사용자의 결제가 실패합니다. 하지만 로그에는 'Error occurred'만 남아 있고, 어떤 사용자인지, 어떤 결제 정보인지, 어느 단계에서 실패했는지 알 수 없습니다. 원인 추적이 불가능합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生产环境里某位用户的支付失败了。可日志里只留下“Error occurred”，既不知道是哪位用户，也不知道是什么支付信息，更不知道是哪个环节失败的。根本无法追查原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.075.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make every change only through the code repository. Even urgent fixes should go through a hotfix branch and your normal deployment pipeline. Minimize server access permissions, and manage infrastructure as code too (Terraform, CloudFormation)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apply every change only through the code repository. Even urgent fixes should go on a hotfix branch and be applied through the normal deployment pipeline. Keep server access to a minimum and manage infrastructure as code too (Terraform, CloudFormation)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "모든 변경은 코드 저장소를 통해서만 반영하세요. 급한 수정도 핫픽스 브랜치를 만들어 정상적인 배포 파이프라인을 통해 적용하세요. 서버 접근 권한은 최소화하고, 인프라도 코드로 관리(Terraform, CloudFormation)하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有改动都只通过代码仓库上线。紧急修复也要新建 hotfix 分支，走正常的部署流水线。把服务器访问权限降到最低，基础设施也用代码来管理（Terraform、CloudFormation）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.075.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand the value of Infrastructure as Code. Traceable, reproducible infrastructure management is the foundation of service stability and team productivity."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand the value of Infrastructure as Code. Traceable, reproducible infrastructure management is the foundation of service stability and team productivity."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "인프라 코드화(Infrastructure as Code)의 가치를 이해합니다. 추적 가능하고 재현 가능한 인프라 관리는 서비스 안정성과 팀 생산성의 기반입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会理解基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code）的价值。可追溯、可复现的基础设施管理，是服务稳定性和团队生产力的基础。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
