    "mistake.076.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Development DB credentials end up in production code, so test data piles up in the real DB, or the dev server's payment module calls the real payment provider. Or debug logging is on in production and performance suffers."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The development database connection details end up in production code, so test data piles up in the real database, or the payment module on the development server calls the real payment provider. Or debug logging is switched on in production and degrades performance."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "개발 환경의 DB 접속 정보가 프로덕션 코드에 들어가서 테스트 데이터가 실제 DB에 쌓이거나, 개발 서버의 결제 모듈이 실제 PG사를 호출합니다. 또는 프로덕션 환경에서 디버그 로그가 켜져 성능이 저하됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发环境的数据库连接信息被带进了生产代码，测试数据写进了真实数据库；或者开发服务器的支付模块调用了真实的支付渠道。又或者生产环境开着调试日志，导致性能下降。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.077.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Always run an automated or manual smoke test after deployment. Make a checklist you can verify within five minutes, covering login, core features (payment, search, and so on), and API health checks, and run it after every deployment. If you can automate it, include it in your deployment pipeline."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Always run a smoke test, automatic or manual, after deployment. Make a checklist that can be verified within five minutes, covering login, the key features (payment, search and so on) and confirming that the API responds correctly, and run it after every deployment. If you can automate it, include it in the deployment pipeline."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "배포 후 자동 또는 수동 스모크 테스트를 반드시 실행하세요. 로그인, 핵심 기능(결제, 검색 등), API 정상 응답 확인 등 5분 이내에 검증할 수 있는 체크리스트를 만들고, 매 배포 후 실행하세요. 자동화할 수 있으면 배포 파이프라인에 포함시키세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发布后一定要执行自动或手动的冒烟测试。列一份 5 分钟内能验证完的检查清单，包括登录、核心功能（支付、搜索等）、API 正常响应等，每次发布后都执行。能自动化的就加进部署流水线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.077.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A finished deployment doesn't mean the code is on the server; it means the service is working. That difference in mindset separates stable services from unstable ones."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A deployment is complete not when the code is on the server, but when the service is working properly. This difference in outlook separates stable services from unstable ones."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "배포 완료는 코드가 서버에 올라간 것이 아니라, 서비스가 정상 작동하는 것입니다. 이 인식의 차이가 안정적인 서비스와 불안정한 서비스를 가릅니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部署完成，不是代码传到了服务器上，而是服务正常运行。这种认知上的差异，区分出稳定的服务和不稳定的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.077.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not smoke testing core features after a deployment"
