          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "스모크 테스트 체크리스트가 있나요? 항목이 충분한가요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你有冒烟测试检查清单吗？项目够全吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.077.retro.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you consider a deployment done when the code is on the server, or when the service is working properly?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you see a deployment as complete when the code is on the server, or when the service is working properly?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "배포 완료를 '코드가 서버에 올라간 것'으로 보나요, '서비스가 정상 작동하는 것'으로 보나요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你认为发布完成是“代码传到了服务器上”，还是“服务正常运行”？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.077.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You get the CI/CD notification that the deployment succeeded and relax. But a config error means login doesn't work, or the new code was never actually loaded, and no one has checked."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You get a CI/CD notification that the deployment succeeded and relax. But a configuration error means login doesn't work, or the new code was never actually loaded, and nobody checks."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "배포가 성공적으로 완료되었다는 CI/CD 알림을 받고 안심합니다. 하지만 설정 오류로 로그인이 안 되거나, 새 코드가 실제로는 로딩되지 않았는데 아무도 확인하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收到 CI/CD “部署成功”的通知就放心了。可是配置错误导致无法登录，或者新代码其实根本没加载，却没人去确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.078.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up cloud cost alerts (such as AWS Budget Alerts) and set a monthly budget limit. Regularly clean up unused resources, and set retention policies for logs and storage. Optimize costs with Reserved Instances or Spot Instances."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up cloud cost alerts (such as AWS Budget Alerts) and set a monthly budget limit. Regularly clear out unused resources, and set retention policies for logs and storage. Optimise costs with Reserved Instances or Spot Instances."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "클라우드 비용 알림(AWS Budget Alert 등)을 설정하고, 월 예산 한도를 정하세요. 사용하지 않는 리소스를 정기적으로 정리하고, 로그와 스토리지에 보존 기간(retention policy)을 설정하세요. Reserved Instance나 Spot Instance로 비용을 최적화하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置云费用告警（AWS Budget Alert 等），定好月度预算上限。定期清理不用的资源，给日志和存储设置保留期限（retention policy）。用预留实例（Reserved Instance）或竞价实例（Spot Instance）优化成本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.078.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn a cost-efficiency mindset. In the cloud you pay for what you use, so managing resources is managing costs. It's also a chance to build business sense."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn a cost-efficiency mindset. In the cloud you pay for what you use, so resource management is cost management. This is an opportunity to develop your business sense."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "비용 효율성(Cost Efficiency) 사고방식을 배웁니다. 클라우드에서는 '쓴 만큼 내는' 것이므로, 리소스 관리가 곧 비용 관리입니다. 이는 비즈니스 감각을 기르는 계기가 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会学到成本效益（Cost Efficiency）的思维。云上是“用多少付多少”，所以资源管理就是成本管理。这也能培养你的商业意识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.078.mistake" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
