            "value" : "有没有因为拖延安全更新而出问题？如果有，之后流程有改变吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.079.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A patch for a known security vulnerability comes out, but you put it off with 'It's not urgent, next time.' A few months later, attackers exploit that vulnerability and user data leaks."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A patch is released for a known security vulnerability, but you put it off with \"it's not urgent, next time\". A few months later an attack exploits that vulnerability and user data is leaked."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "알려진 보안 취약점에 대한 패치가 나왔지만, '당장 급한 건 아니니까 다음에'라며 미룹니다. 몇 달 후 해당 취약점을 이용한 공격을 받아 사용자 데이터가 유출됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已知安全漏洞的补丁出来了，却想着“又不急，下次再说”。几个月后，遭到利用该漏洞的攻击，用户数据泄露。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.080.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up automatic backups and run a restore test every quarter at the least. Judge a backup by whether it can be restored. Document the restore procedure, and define how long a restore takes (RTO) and how much data loss is acceptable (RPO)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up automatic backups and run a restore test every quarter at the very least. Judge a backup by whether it can be restored. Document the restore procedure, and define how long a restore takes (RTO) and how much data loss is acceptable (RPO)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "자동 백업을 설정하고, 매 분기(최소) 복원 테스트를 실행하세요. 백업 = 복원 가능 여부로 판단하세요. 복원 절차를 문서화하고, 복원에 걸리는 시간(RTO)과 허용 가능한 데이터 손실 시간(RPO)을 정의하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置自动备份，并且（至少）每季度做一次恢复测试。以“能不能恢复”来判断备份是否有效。把恢复步骤写成文档，并确定恢复所需时间（RTO）和可接受的数据丢失时间（RPO）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.080.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn the importance of a disaster recovery plan. Having a backup and being able to restore are completely different things, and an unverified backup is the same as no backup."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn the importance of a disaster recovery plan. \"We have a backup\" and \"we can restore it\" are completely different matters, and an unverified backup is as good as none."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "재해 복구(Disaster Recovery) 계획의 중요성을 배웁니다. '백업이 있다'와 '복원할 수 있다'는 완전히 다른 문제이며, 검증되지 않은 백업은 없는 것과 같습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会认识到灾难恢复（Disaster Recovery）计划的重要性。“有备份”和“能恢复”完全是两码事，没验证过的备份等于没有备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
