    "mistake.083.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you serve over HTTP, anyone on the network can peek at the data. A user logging in on cafe Wi-Fi sends their password in plain text, and it can be stolen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you serve over HTTP, anyone on the network can snoop on the data. The password of a user logging in over a café's wifi is sent in plain text and can be stolen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "HTTP로 서비스하면 네트워크 상의 누구나 데이터를 엿볼 수 있습니다. 카페 와이파이에서 로그인하는 사용자의 비밀번호가 평문으로 전송되어 탈취될 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 HTTP 提供服务，网络上的任何人都能窥探数据。在咖啡店 Wi-Fi 里登录的用户，密码会以明文传输，可能被窃取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.084.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In production, show users only a friendly message like 'Something went wrong. Please try again in a moment.' Keep the detailed errors in server logs only. Separate the level of error detail by environment (development vs. production)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In production, show users only a friendly message such as \"Something went wrong. Please try again shortly.\" Keep the detailed error only in the server logs. Separate the level of error detail by environment (development and production)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "프로덕션에서는 사용자에게 '문제가 발생했습니다. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.' 같은 친절한 메시지만 보여주세요. 상세 에러는 서버 로그에만 남기세요. 환경(개발/운영)에 따라 에러 표시 수준을 분리하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生产环境只给用户看“出现问题了，请稍后重试”这类友好的提示。详细错误只记录在服务器日志里。根据环境（开发/生产）区分错误显示的详细程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.084.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand the principle of minimizing information exposure, a close relative of the Principle of Least Privilege, in a security context. The less information you give an attacker, the safer the system."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand the principle of minimising information exposure, in the same spirit as the principle of least privilege, in a security context. The less information you give an attacker, the safer the system."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "정보 노출 최소화(Principle of Least Privilege)의 원칙을 보안 맥락에서 이해합니다. 공격자에게 제공하는 정보가 적을수록 시스템은 안전합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会在安全的语境下理解最小暴露信息的原则（Principle of Least Privilege）。提供给攻击者的信息越少，系统越安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
