    "mistake.084.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an error happens in production, the stack trace, DB query, file paths, and server version are shown to the user as they are. An attacker uses this information to learn the structure of your system and find weaknesses."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an error occurs in production, the stack trace, database query, file paths and server version are shown to the user as they are. Attackers use this information to work out the system's structure and look for vulnerabilities."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "프로덕션에서 에러가 나면 스택 트레이스, DB 쿼리, 파일 경로, 서버 버전이 사용자 화면에 그대로 표시됩니다. 공격자는 이 정보로 시스템 구조를 파악하고 취약점을 찾습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生产环境一出错，堆栈跟踪、数据库查询、文件路径、服务器版本就原样显示在用户屏幕上。攻击者借此了解系统结构，找出漏洞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.085.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do all permission checks on the server. Frontend checks are for UX (avoiding unnecessary API calls); the security boundary is always the server. Verify authentication and authorization on every API endpoint."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perform all permission checks on the server. Frontend checks are for UX (avoiding unnecessary API calls); the security boundary is always the server. Check authentication and authorisation at every API endpoint."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "모든 권한 검증은 서버에서 수행하세요. 프론트엔드 검증은 UX를 위한 것(불필요한 API 호출 방지)이고, 보안 경계는 반드시 서버입니다. 모든 API 엔드포인트에서 인증(Authentication)과 인가(Authorization)를 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有权限校验都在服务端完成。前端校验是为了用户体验（避免不必要的 API 调用），安全边界必须在服务端。每个 API 接口都要确认认证（Authentication）和授权（Authorization）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.085.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You internalize the fundamental security principle of never trusting the client. This principle applies to web, mobile, and APIs alike."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You absorb the fundamental security principle of never trusting the client. This principle applies across web, mobile and API work."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "클라이언트를 절대 신뢰하지 않는다(Never Trust the Client)는 보안의 근본 원칙을 체득합니다. 이 원칙은 웹, 모바일, API 모든 영역에 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会真正理解“永远不要信任客户端（Never Trust the Client）”这一安全根本原则。这个原则适用于 Web、移动端、API 等所有领域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.085.mistake" : {
