    "mistake.088.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A library you added three years ago has a serious security vulnerability (CVE), and nobody knows. An attack using that vulnerability actually happens, and your service is compromised."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A serious security vulnerability (CVE) is found in a library you added three years ago, but nobody knows. An attack exploiting it actually happens and the service is compromised."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "3년 전에 추가한 라이브러리에 심각한 보안 취약점(CVE)이 발견되었지만 아무도 모르고 있습니다. 해당 취약점을 이용한 공격이 실제로 발생하여 서비스가 침해됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "三年前引入的库被发现有严重安全漏洞（CVE），却没人知道。利用该漏洞的攻击真的发生了，服务被攻陷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.089.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Store tokens in cookies with the httpOnly and Secure flags set. httpOnly cookies can't be accessed from JavaScript, so they're safe from XSS. Add CSRF protection as well, and set a sensible token expiration. Use the Refresh Token pattern to keep Access Tokens short-lived."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Store tokens in cookies with the httpOnly and Secure flags set. An httpOnly cookie can't be accessed from JavaScript, so it is safe from XSS. Apply CSRF protection as well and set a suitable token expiry time. Use the refresh token pattern to keep the access token's lifetime short."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "httpOnly, Secure 플래그가 설정된 쿠키에 토큰을 저장하세요. httpOnly 쿠키는 JavaScript에서 접근할 수 없으므로 XSS에 안전합니다. CSRF 방어를 함께 적용하고, 토큰 만료 시간을 적절히 설정하세요. Refresh Token 패턴을 사용하여 Access Token의 수명을 짧게 유지하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把令牌存在设置了 httpOnly、Secure 标志的 Cookie 里。httpOnly Cookie 无法被 JavaScript 访问，所以能抵御 XSS。同时做好 CSRF 防护，并合理设置令牌过期时间。使用 Refresh Token 模式，让 Access Token 的有效期保持较短。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.089.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand best practices for web authentication security. Understanding and defending against attack vectors like XSS and CSRF is a core skill for web developers."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You understand best practice for web authentication security. Being able to understand and defend against attack vectors such as XSS and CSRF is a core skill for web developers."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "웹 인증 보안의 모범 사례를 이해합니다. XSS, CSRF 같은 공격 벡터를 이해하고 방어하는 능력은 웹 개발자의 핵심 역량입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会了解 Web 认证安全的最佳实践。理解并防御 XSS、CSRF 这类攻击途径，是 Web 开发者的核心能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
