    "mistake.098.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a service with only 10 users, you spend a week cutting login response time from 200 ms to 50 ms. Users don't notice the difference, and if you'd spent that time building core features, you could have won more users."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You invest a week in cutting a login response time from 200ms to 50ms for a service that still has only 10 users. Users can't feel the difference, and if you had spent that time on the core features, you could have won more users."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "아직 사용자가 10명인 서비스의 로그인 응답 시간을 200ms에서 50ms로 줄이기 위해 일주일을 투자합니다. 사용자는 차이를 느끼지 못하고, 그 시간에 핵심 기능을 개발했으면 사용자를 더 확보할 수 있었습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务才 10 个用户，却花一周时间把登录响应时间从 200ms 降到 50ms。用户根本感觉不到差别，而把这段时间用来开发核心功能，本可以获得更多用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.099.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put long-running work on a message queue (RabbitMQ, SQS) and process it in the background. Have the API respond immediately with just 'request received,' and deliver the result asynchronously by WebSocket, push notification, email, and so on. Use async/await correctly so threads can do other work during I/O."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put long-running work onto a message queue (RabbitMQ, SQS) and process it in the background. Have the API respond immediately with just \"request received\" and deliver the result asynchronously by WebSocket, push notification, email and so on. Use async/await correctly so threads can do other work during I/O."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오래 걸리는 작업은 메시지 큐(RabbitMQ, SQS)에 넣고 백그라운드에서 처리하세요. API는 '요청 접수됨'만 즉시 응답하고, 처리 결과는 웹소켓, 푸시 알림, 이메일 등으로 비동기 전달하세요. async/await를 올바르게 사용하여 I/O 작업 중 스레드가 다른 일을 할 수 있게 하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耗时的任务放进消息队列（RabbitMQ、SQS），在后台处理。API 只立即返回“请求已接收”，处理结果通过 WebSocket、推送通知、邮件等异步送达。正确使用 async/await，让线程在 I/O 操作期间能去做别的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.099.growth" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn asynchronous programming patterns and message-driven architecture. Using sync and async correctly determines your system's responsiveness and scalability."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You learn asynchronous programming patterns and message-based architecture. Using synchronous and asynchronous processing correctly decides a system's responsiveness and scalability."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "비동기 프로그래밍 패턴과 메시지 기반 아키텍처를 배웁니다. 동기와 비동기의 올바른 사용은 시스템의 응답성과 확장성을 결정합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会学到异步编程模式和基于消息的架构。同步和异步用得对不对，决定了系统的响应能力和可扩展性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.099.mistake" : {
