    "mistake.099.situation" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You run file uploads, email sending, and external API calls synchronously inside request handling. When the external service is slow, the user waits tens of seconds for a response, and server threads are tied up so other requests can't be handled either."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You run file uploads, email sending and external API calls synchronously inside request handling. When the external service is slow, users wait tens of seconds for a response, and server threads are tied up so other requests can't be handled either."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "파일 업로드, 이메일 발송, 외부 API 호출을 요청 처리 안에서 동기로 실행합니다. 외부 서비스가 느리면 사용자가 응답을 수십 초 동안 기다려야 하고, 서버 스레드가 점유되어 다른 요청도 처리할 수 없게 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件上传、发送邮件、调用外部 API，都在请求处理过程中同步执行。外部服务一慢，用户就得等好几十秒才能收到响应，服务器线程被占满，其他请求也处理不了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mistake.100.action" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use load testing tools such as k6, JMeter, or Locust. Run load tests at two to three times your expected traffic and identify the bottlenecks (DB connections, memory, CPU, network). Check for performance regressions regularly (quarterly at the least)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use a load testing tool such as k6, JMeter or Locust. Run load tests at two to three times your expected traffic and identify the bottlenecks (database connections, memory, CPU, network). Check for performance regressions regularly, at least quarterly."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "k6, JMeter, Locust 같은 부하 테스트 도구를 사용하세요. 예상 트래픽의 2~3배로 부하 테스트를 실시하고, 병목 지점(DB 커넥션, 메모리, CPU, 네트워크)을 파악하세요. 주기적으로(최소 분기별) 성능 회귀를 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 k6、JMeter、Locust 这类压测工具。以预期流量的 2~3 倍做压力测试，找出瓶颈点（数据库连接、内存、CPU、网络）。定期（至少每季度）检查性能回退。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
